[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  ➡️ A single-user, local-first / self-hosted web application backed by a local database (e.g., SQLite) with easy\u001b[K\r\n  backup/export, avoiding unnecessary auth and cloud infrastructure complexity.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> single user\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ4\u001b[m - \u001b[1mSupplier & BOM Import / Lookup\u001b[m: How do you expect data to enter the system? Will you mostly enter parts and\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\r\n  BOMs manually / via CSV import, or do you want automated part lookup/scraping from suppliers (like Mouser, DigiKey,\r\n  Tayda, LCSC)?\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Support manual entry and CSV/spreadsheet import for BOMs and inventory first, keeping live third-party supplier\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n  API integrations (Mouser/DigiKey) out of scope for the initial spec (while allowing supplier part numbers/URLs to\r\n  be stored on items).\r\n\n\u001b[90m"]
