[0.000, "o", "─────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1m/Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/03-csv-import-and-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m1 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m# CSV Import & Shopping List Export Workflows\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m2 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m3 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mType: grilling\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mStatus: open\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mBlocked by: 02\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m                                                                                                                \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Question\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mWhat are the exact workflows and column/field mappings for importing Components and Kit Build BOMs via CSV, how\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;"]
[0.000, "o", "15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mare duplicate or near-match components reconciled during import, and how are missing/shortfall parts across one\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mor multiple Kit Builds aggregated and exported as supplier shopping lists?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
[3.751, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[31A  rendered HTML/HTMX + local Turso stack?\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mProposed Frontier & Blocked Decision Tickets:\u001b[?7h\u001b[48G\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mComponent Category Taxonomy & Parametric Schema\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgrilling\u001b[m, unblocked): Define the exact categories, structured\r\n  attributes, value normalization/units (e.g., \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m vs \u001b[94m4700Ω\u001b[m), and storage location model.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mBOM Matching, Stock Allocation, and Build Lifecycle\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgrilling\u001b[m, blocked by \u001b[94m01\u001b[m): Decide how BOM lines match\r\n  against \u001b[94mComponent\u001b[m stock (exact part vs. parametric spec match, handling partial kits where some parts come in the\u001b[K\r\n  box), when stock is reserved vs. deducted, and exact \u001b[94mKit Build\u001b[m status transitions.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mCSV Import & Shopping List Export Workflows\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgrilling\u001b[m, blocked by \u001b[94m02\u001b[m): Define how messy BOM/inventory CSVs are\r\n  mapped/reconciled on import and how missing parts across one or more builds are aggregated into a supplier shopping\r\n  list.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mRust + "]
[0.000, "o", "HTMX + Local Turso Crate & App Architecture\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgrilling\u001b[m, unblocked): Pin down the specific Rust\r\n  web/template/Turso crates (e.g., \u001b[94maxum\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m/\u001b[94maskama\u001b[m/\u001b[94mminijinja\u001b[m, \u001b[94mturso\u001b[m/\u001b[94mlibsql\u001b[m), local file storage for\u001b[K\r\n  schematics/attachments, and schema migration strategy.\u001b[K\r\n  5. \u001b[1mCore UI Views & HTMX Interaction Prototype\u001b[m (\u001b[94mprototype\u001b[m, blocked by \u001b[94m01\u001b[m, \u001b[94m02\u001b[m, \u001b[94m04\u001b[m): Prototype the key HTMX workflows\u001b[K\r\n  (fast parametric component search/filtering, interactive BOM checklist & stock readiness view, and bench build-mode\u001b[K\r\n  view).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Yes, create the wayfinding map with these tickets and record \u001b[94mdocs/adr/0001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u001b[m.\u001b[?7h\u001b[106G\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> lgtm\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(0"]
