[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AGreat call—adding \u001b[1mModules & Sub-Assemblies\u001b[m (MCU dev boards like Daisy Seed, Teensy, Raspberry Pi Pico, Arduino,\r\n  OLED/LCD display modules, daughterboards, pre-assembled DSP/reverb modules like Belton Brick) as a 9th category\r\n  makes a ton of sense for modern pedal and synth builds.\u001b[K\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mParametric Attributes & Schema Storage\u001b[m: How should the common fields and the category-specific parametric\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  attributes of a \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m be structured and persisted in the database?\u001b[?7h\u001b[73G\r\n\u001b[K\n  Every \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m shares core catalog fields:\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mName / Part Number\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mTL072IP\u001b[m, \u001b[94m10kΩ 1/4W Metal Film\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDaisy Seed\u001b[m)\n\u001b[68D\u001b[1mCategory\u001b[m (one of the 9 core categories + Other) & \u001b[1mSubtype\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mOp-Amp\u001b[m, \u001b[94mFilm Capacitor\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMCU Board\u001b[m)\n\u001b[99D\u001b[1mMounting / Package\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mThrough-Hole\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSMD 0805\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTO-92\u001b[m, \u001b[94m16mm PCB Rig"]
[0.000, "o", "ht-Angle\u001b[m, \u001b[94mModule\u001b[m)\u001b[K\n\u001b[93D\u001b[1mQuantity on Hand\u001b[m (integer) & \u001b[1mLow-Stock Threshold\u001b[m (optional integer for restock alerts)\u001b[K\n\u001b[86D\u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m (to be modeled in Q4)\u001b[K\n\u001b[37D\u001b[1mupplier Info & Notes\u001b[m (e.g., primary supplier name, supplier part number, datasheet/product URL, freeform notes)\r\n\u001b[K\n  For the \u001b[1mcategory-specific parametric attributes\u001b[m, here is the proposed attribute set per category:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mResistors\u001b[m: \u001b[94mresistance_ohms\u001b[m (normalized numeric Ω), \u001b[94mtolerance\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m1%\u001b[m, \u001b[94m5%\u001b[m), \u001b[94mpower_rating_watts\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m0.25W\u001b[m),\r\n  \u001b[94mcomposition\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mMetal Film\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCarbon Film\u001b[m, \u001b[94mWirewound\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mCapacitors\u001b[m: \u001b[94mcapacitance_farads\u001b[m (normalized numeric pF/F), \u001b[94mvoltage_rating_volts\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m50V\u001b[m), \u001b[94mdielectric\u001b[m (e.g.,\r\n  \u001b[94mPolyester/Film\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC0G/NP0\u001b[m, \u001b[94mX7R\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAluminum Electrolytic\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTantalum\u001b[m), \u001b[94mtolerance\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpolarized\u001b[m (bool), \u001b[94mlead_spacin"]
