[0.083, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mParametric Attributes & Schema Storage\u001b[m: How should the common fields and the category-specific parametric\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  attributes of a \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m be structured and persisted in the database?\r\n\n  Every \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m shares core catalog fields:\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mName / Part Number\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mTL072IP\u001b[m, \u001b[94m10kΩ 1/4W Metal Film\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDaisy Seed\u001b[m)\r\n  • \u001b[1mCategory\u001b[m (one of the 9 core categories + Other) & \u001b[1mSubtype\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mOp-Amp\u001b[m, \u001b[94mFilm Capacitor\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMCU Board\u001b[m)\r\n  • \u001b[1mMounting / Package\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mThrough-Hole\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSMD 0805\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTO-92\u001b[m, \u001b[94m16mm PCB Right-Angle\u001b[m, \u001b[94mModule\u001b[m)\r\n  • \u001b[1mQuantity on Hand\u001b[m (integer) & \u001b[1mLow-Stock Threshold\u001b[m (optional integer for restock alerts)\r\n  • \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m (to be modeled in Q4)\r\n  • \u001b[1mSupplier Info & Notes\u001b[m (e.g., primary supplier name, supplier part number, datasheet/product URL, freeform notes)\r\n\n  For the \u001b[1mcategory-specific "]
