[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[19A\u001b[70C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3930429d4706450a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ6\u001b[m - \u001b[1mDomain Term & Lot Metadata (\"Stock Lot\" vs \"Stash\")\u001b[m: When you have two separate bags of the same \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[m\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[8Zbag of transistors from\n\u001b[69D\u001b[90m.\u001b[94m.\u001b[m\n\n\u001b[10D\u001b[?2026l"]
