[0.000, "o", "ther / Custom\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[94mResistors\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCapacitors\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSemiconductors — Discrete\u001b[m, \u001b[94mIntegrated Circuits (ICs)\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPotentiometers & Encoders\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mSwitches, Jacks & Connectors\u001b[m, \u001b[94mInductors, Transformers & Magnetics\u001b[m, \u001b[94mEnclosures, Knobs & Mechanical Hardware\u001b[m, and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mModules & Sub-Assemblies\u001b[m (MCU boards, displays, daughterboards, reverb bricks), each with a subtype field.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mHybrid Parametric Schema\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mFirst-class SQL columns\u001b[m on \u001b[94mcomponents\u001b[m: \u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94msubtype\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage_or_mounting\u001b[m, \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(preserving the exact entered/imported spec string with tolerance, pot curve, etc.), normalized numeric columns\r\n\u001b[7C\u001b[94mresistance_ohms\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcapacitance_pf\u001b[m, \u001b[94minductance_uh\u001b[m, \u001b[94mvoltage_rating_volts\u001b[m), \u001b[94mlow_stock_threshold\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdatasheet_url\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[6D• \u001b[1mValidated \u001b[94;22mspecs_json\u001b[39;1m column\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[m: stores the category-specific attributes (e.g., \u001b[94mtaper\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdielectric\u001b[m, \u001b[94mtolerance\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mpower_rating_watts\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpolarity_or_channel\u001b[m, \u001b[94mconfiguration\u001b[m, \u001b[94mshaft_type\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmodel_or_platform\u001b[m, \u001b[94minterface_or_voltage\u001b[m).\r\n  3. \u001b[1mElectrical Value Normalization + Verbatim Spec Preservation\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Deterministic Rust parser/normalizer that accepts shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m47n\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100kA\u001b[m, \u001b[94mB50k\u001b[m) on both\r\n\u001b[6Ccomponent entry and search queries, extracting canonical base numbers (\u001b[94mresistance_ohms\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcapacitance_pf\u001b[m, etc.)\r\n\u001b[6Cand parametric tokens (like pot taper \u001b[94mA\u001b[m/\u001b[94mB\u001b[m/\u001b[94mC\u001b[m or tolerance \u001b[94m1%\u001b[m) while always storing and displaying \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7Clongsid\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[12D\u001b[?2026l"]
