[0.000, "o", "ectronics component categories and their structured parametric\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39mattributes, how are electrical values normalized and searched (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4k7`\u001b[39m vs \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4.7kΩ`\u001b[39m vs \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4700`\u001b[39m), and how are\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39mphysical storage locations (bins, drawers, binders) modeled?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mWhat is the exact taxonomy of audio electronics component categories and their structured parametric\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mattributes, how are electrical values normalized and searched (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4k7`\u001b[39m vs \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4.7kΩ`\u001b[39m vs \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4700`\u001b[39m), and how are\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mphysical storage locations (bins, drawers, binders) modeled?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m##"]
[0.000, "o", " Answer\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m### 1. Component Category Taxonomy\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mNine built-in core categories (plus \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Other / Custom`\u001b[39m), each with a \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`subtype`\u001b[39m field:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 39 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[4.810, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[30A\u001b[35D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mFirst-class SQL columns\u001b[m on \u001b[94mcomponents\u001b[m: \u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94msubtype\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage_or_mounting\u001b[m, \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C(preserving the exact entered/imported spec string with tolerance, pot curve, etc.), normalized numeric columns\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K (\u001b[94mresistance_ohms\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcapacitance_pf\u001b[m, \u001b[94minductance_uh\u001b[m, \u001b[94mvoltage_rating_volts\u001b[m), \u001b[94mlow_stock_threshold\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdatasheet_url\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[7D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mValidated \u001b[94;22mspecs_json\u001b[39;1m column\u001b[m: stores the category-specific attributes (e.g., \u001b[94mtaper\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdielectric\u001b[m, \u001b[94mtolerance\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mpower_rating_watts\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpolarity_or_channel\u001b[m, \u001b[94mconfiguration\u001b[m, \u001b[94mshaft_type\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmodel_or_platform\u001b[m, \u001b[94minterface_or_voltage\u001b[m).\r\n  3. \u001b[1mElectrical Value Normalization + Verbatim Spec Preservation\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[60D\u001b[1K • Deterministic Rust parser/normalizer that accepts shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.7kΩ"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m, \u001b[94m47n\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100kA\u001b[m, \u001b[94mB50k\u001b[m) on both\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K component entry and search queries, extracting canonical base numbers (\u001b[94mresistance_ohms\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcapacitance_pf\u001b[m, etc.)\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K and parametric tokens (like pot taper \u001b[94mA\u001b[m/\u001b[94mB\u001b[m/\u001b[94mC\u001b[m or tolerance \u001b[94m1%\u001b[m) while always storing and displaying \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K alongside the canonicalized display value.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mHierarchical \u001b[94;22mStorage Location\u001b[39;1m & Multi-Location \u001b[94;22mStock Lot\u001b[m:\n\u001b[57D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mStorage Location\u001b[m: Self-referential tree (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mkind\u001b[m [\u001b[94mCrate\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBinder\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDrawer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBag\u001b[m, \u001b[94mOther\u001b[m], \u001b[94mparent_id\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m) so moving a bag or box reparents everything nested inside it (\u001b[94mStorage Locations\u001b[m, \u001b[94mStock Lots\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mKit\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mBuilds\u001b[m) in one operation.\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mStock Lot\u001b[m: Tracks a physical quantity of a \u001b[94mComponent\u001b[m at a \u001b[9"]
[0.000, "o", "4mStorage Location\u001b[m (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlocation_id\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m, \u001b[94msupplier\u001b[m, \u001b[94msupplier_part_no\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlot_notes\u001b[m), supporting inline \u001b[94m+1 / -1\u001b[m for single-lot components, per-lot\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K breakdown when duplicate bags exist across locations, and a \u001b[1mMerge Lots\u001b[m action when physically combining bags.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  Shall I record this resolution and close **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk88561cee78068b6d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/01-component-category-taxonomy-and-parametric-schema.md\u0007Component Category Taxonomy & Parametric Schema\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007**?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(01-component-category-taxonomy-and-parametric-schema.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o "]
