[0.000, "o", "nd parametric tokens (like pot taper \u001b[94mA\u001b[m/\u001b[94mB\u001b[m/\u001b[94mC\u001b[m or tolerance \u001b[94m1%\u001b[m) while always storing and displaying \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Calongside the canonicalized display value.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mHierarchical \u001b[94;22mStorage Location\u001b[39;1m & Multi-Location \u001b[94;22mStock Lot\u001b[m:\n\u001b[56D• \u001b[94mStorage Location\u001b[m: Self-referential tree (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mkind\u001b[m [\u001b[94mCrate\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBinder\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDrawer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBag\u001b[m, \u001b[94mOther\u001b[m], \u001b[94mparent_id\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m) so moving a bag or box reparents everything nested inside it (\u001b[94mStorage Locations\u001b[m, \u001b[94mStock Lots\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mKit\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mBuilds\u001b[m) in one operation.\n\u001b[25D• \u001b[94mStock Lot\u001b[m: Tracks a physical quantity of a \u001b[94mComponent\u001b[m at a \u001b[94mStorage Location\u001b[m (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlocation_id\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m, \u001b[94msupplier\u001b[m, \u001b[94msupplier_part_no\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlot_notes\u001b[m), supporting inline \u001b[94m+1 / -1\u001b[m for single-lot components, per-lot\r\n\u001b[6Cbreakdown when du"]
