[0.100, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[26A\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mBOM Line Component Linking & Partial Kits\u001b[m: When adding or importing a \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m onto a \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mR1,\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Dual Spec + Optional \u001b[94;22mcomponent_id\u001b[39;1m Link with \"Included in Kit\" support)\u001b[m—this lets you import a full BOM\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\r\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[4Ct\u001b[?2026l"]
