[0.000, "o", "ulfillment (\u001b[94;22mUnallocated\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mAllocated / Kitted\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mInstalled\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mIncluded in Kit\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mUnallocated (Planning / Readiness Check)\u001b[m: The \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m links to a \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m (or shows parametric candidate\r\n\u001b[6Cstock). Readiness compare checks \u001b[94mquantity_required\u001b[m against \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m (\u001b[94mTotal On Hand across Stock Lots −\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mTotal Soft-Reserved by other builds\u001b[m).\n\u001b[37D• \u001b[1mAllocated (Soft-Reserved vs. Physically Kitted)\u001b[m:\r\n\t  • \u001b[1mSoft-Reserved (\u001b[94;22mReserved\u001b[39;1m in place)\u001b[m: Marks the quantity reserved for this \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m (optionally pinned to a\r\n\t  specific \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m, or against the \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m generally) without moving the parts yet; reduces \u001b[3mAvailable\u001b[m\r\n\t  \u001b[3mStock\u001b[m for other builds while leaving physical \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m counts untouched so your drawer counts still match\r\n\t  reality.\n\u001b[8D• \u001b[1mPhysically Kitted / Picked (\u001b[94;22mPicked\u001b[39;1m into the Ki"]
[0.000, "o", "t Build's box)\u001b[m: When you pull parts from a drawer/binder\r\n\t  and drop them into the \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m's project box/bag, the app deducts \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m from the source \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m and\r\n\t  records the allocation on the \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m (remembering \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m so if you cancel the build or un-kit the\r\n\t  part, 1 click returns it to its original \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m).\n\u001b[56D• \u001b[1mInstalled / Consumed (\u001b[94;22mInstalled\u001b[39;1m on PCB)\u001b[m: When soldered/assembled onto the build during bench work, the \u001b[1mBOM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mLine\u001b[m transitions to \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m (if it wasn't already deducted at \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m, it deducts from the chosen \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cnow).\r\n  2. \u001b[1mImmediate Deduction Only (No Soft-Reserve / Kitting Distinction)\u001b[m: Allocating a part on a BOM immediately\r\n  decrements the \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m quanti\r\n⡿  \u001b[90mWorking...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
