[0.000, "o", "ist Lifecycle + Local Attachments + Timestamped Build Log\u001b[m:\n\u001b[86D• \u001b[1mKit Build Statuses\u001b[m:\r\n\t  1. \u001b[94mWishlist / Planned\u001b[m: Idea or queued project; checks stock readiness and contributes optional shortages to\r\n\t  shopping lists, no parts physically pulled yet.\r\n\t  2. \u001b[94mSourcing / Waiting on Parts\u001b[m: Active project waiting on an order or missing parts.\r\n\t  3. \u001b[94mReady to Build (Kitted)\u001b[m: All required parts are either available/reserved or physically picked into the\r\n\t  \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m's \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m box.\r\n\t  4. \u001b[94mOn the Bench (In Progress)\u001b[m: Actively soldering/assembling; opens the bench checklist view (\u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m\r\n\t  progress across \u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m).\r\n\t  5. \u001b[94mBoxing / Troubleshooting\u001b[m: Board populated, either awaiting enclosure drilling/off-board wiring or\r\n\t  actively debugging audio/power issues on the bench (the classic DIY pedal \"it works on bypass but no effect\r\n\t  sound\" stage!).\r\n\t  6. \u001b[94mCompleted\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94mShelved / Abandoned\u001b[m): Build finished (o"]
