[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ4\u001b[m - \u001b[1mKit Build Lifecycle Statuses, Documentation Attachments, and Bench/Troubleshooting Logs\u001b[m: What statuses\u001b[?7h\u001b[113G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  should a \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m move through from initial idea to finished pedal/synth module, and how should build docs,\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\r\n  schematics, and troubleshooting notes be structured on it?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1m(Recommended) Six-Stage Hobbyist Lifecycle + Local Attachments + Timestamped Build Log\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[1mKit Build Statuses\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[21D    1. \u001b[94mWishlist / Planned\u001b[m: Idea or queued project; checks stock readiness and contributes optional shortages to\r\n\t  shopping lists, no parts physically pulled yet.\u001b[K\r\n\t  2. \u001b[94mSourcing / Waiting on Parts\u001b[m: Active project waiting on an order or missing parts.\r\n\t  3. \u001b[94mReady to Build (Kitted)\u001b[m: All required parts are either available/reserved or physically picked into the\r\n\t  \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m's \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m box.\u001b[K\r\n\t  4. \u001b[94mOn the Bench (In Progress)\u001b[m: Actively soldering/a"]
[0.000, "o", "ssembling; opens the bench checklist view (\u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m\r\n\t  progress across \u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\t  5. \u001b[94mBoxing / Troubleshooting\u001b[m: Board populated, either awaiting enclosure drilling/off-board wiring or\r\n\t  actively debugging audio/power issues on the bench (the classic DIY pedal \"it works on bypass but no effect\r\n\t  sound\" stage!).\u001b[K\r\n\t  6. \u001b[94mCompleted\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94mShelved / Abandoned\u001b[m): Build finished (or parked indefinitely; if \u001b[94mAbandoned\u001b[m, prompts\r\n\t  whether to return \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m / \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m parts back to their source \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m, while leaving \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m soldered\r\n\t  parts consumed unless manually salvaged).\u001b[K\n\u001b[45D• \u001b[1mAttachments & Links\u001b[m: A \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m holds external URLs (source project page, forum thread) plus locally stored\r\n\u001b[6Cfiles (\u001b[94mSchematic PDF\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBuild Doc / Drill Template\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPhotos\u001b[m) stored on disk in a local attachments directory and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Clinked via a \u001b[94mkit_attachments\u001b[m table.\u001b[K\n\u001b[35D• \u001b[1mBench & Tro"]
[0.000, "o", "ubleshooting Log\u001b[m: Alongside a general \u001b[94mdescription / overview\u001b[m markdown field, each \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m has a\r\n\u001b[6Ctimestamped \u001b[94mkit_log_entries\u001b[m stream (entry type: \u001b[94mNote\u001b[m, \u001b[94mMeasurement / Voltage Reading\u001b[m, \u001b[94mModification\u001b[m,\u001b[K\n\u001b[98D\u001b[94mTroubleshooting\u001b[m) so you can record pin voltages, mod notes, and debugging steps chronologically.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSimple 3-Status Lifecycle (\u001b[94;22mPlanned\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mIn Progress\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mCompleted\u001b[39;1m) with a Single Notes Textarea\u001b[m: Minimal status enum\r\n  an\u001b[K\n\n\n\b\b\u001b[?2026l"]
