[0.049, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[?7l\u001b[31A\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ5\u001b[m - \u001b[1mCloning a Kit Build\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd55d4b18152a8b48;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/GLOSSARY.md#L19-L21\u0007GLOSSARY.md:19-21\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and our \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka8fec6373ff6fa3a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md#L28\u0007map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, we kept \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m as a single entity rather than\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  splitting into \"Project Template\" vs. \"Production Run\", with optional cloning if you ever build a second copy of a\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n  pedal or synth module (e.g., building two DIY VCOs for a synth rack, or building a second overdrive pedal for a\u001b[K\r\n  friend).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  When you click \u001b[1m\"Clone Kit Build\"\u001b[m on an existing \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m, what should be copied and what should be reset?\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1m(Recommended) Copy Spec, BOM Lines (with Component Links), and Reference Docs; Reset Status, Allocations, and\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mBench Logs\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n  "]
[0.000, "o", "    • \u001b[1mCopied\u001b[m: Build name (with \u001b[94m(Copy)\u001b[m or custom name prompt), category/type, description, external URLs,\r\n\u001b[6Cschematic/build-doc attachments (referencing the same PDFs without duplicating large files on disk), and all\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m including their \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m, \u001b[94mreference_designators\u001b[m, \u001b[94mquantity_required\u001b[m, linked \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94msubstitution_note\u001b[m, and whether a line is \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[57D• \u001b[1mReset\u001b[m: Status resets to \u001b[94mWishlist / Planned\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlocation_id\u001b[m is cleared (or prompted), every non-kit \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cresets to \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m (\u001b[94mquantity_allocated = 0\u001b[m, \u001b[94msource_lot_id = NULL\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mkit_log_entries\u001b[m / build photos start\r\n\u001b[6Cfresh.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mShallow Copy Only (BOM Spec Text Only)\u001b[m: Cloning copies only the raw BOM text without preserving any \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m\r\n  links or schematic PDF attachments.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Copy BOM Lines with their \u001b[94;22mco"]
