[14.625, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[J\u001b[30A  friend).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  When you click \u001b[1m\"Clone Kit Build\"\u001b[m on an existing \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m, what should be copied and what should be reset?\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1m(Recommended) Copy Spec, BOM Lines (with Component Links), and Reference Docs; Reset Status, Allocations, and\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mBench Logs\u001b[m:\n\u001b[8D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mCopied\u001b[m: Build name (with \u001b[94m(Copy)\u001b[m or custom name prompt), category/type, description, external URLs,\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K schematic/build-doc attachments (referencing the same PDFs without duplicating large files on disk), and all\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m including their \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m, \u001b[94mreference_designators\u001b[m, \u001b[94mquantity_required\u001b[m, linked \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94msubstitution_note\u001b[m, and whether a line is \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[58D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mReset\u001b[m: Status resets to \u001b[94mWishlist / Planned\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlocation_id\u001b[m is cleared (or prompted), every non-kit \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K resets to \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m (\u001b[94mquantity_allocated = 0\u001b[m, \u001b["]
