[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  friend).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  When you click \u001b[1m\"Clone Kit Build\"\u001b[m on an existing \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m, what should be copied and what should be reset?\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1m(Recommended) Copy Spec, BOM Lines (with Component Links), and Reference Docs; Reset Status, Allocations, and\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mBench Logs\u001b[m:\n\u001b[7D• \u001b[1mCopied\u001b[m: Build name (with \u001b[94m(Copy)\u001b[m or custom name prompt), category/type, description, external URLs,\r\n\u001b[6Cschematic/build-doc attachments (referencing the same PDFs without duplicating large files on disk), and all\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m including their \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m, \u001b[94mreference_designators\u001b[m, \u001b[94mquantity_required\u001b[m, linked \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94msubstitution_note\u001b[m, and whether a line is \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m.\n\u001b[57D• \u001b[1mReset\u001b[m: Status resets to \u001b[94mWishlist / Planned\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlocation_id\u001b[m is cleared (or prompted), every non-kit \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cresets to \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m (\u001b[94mquantity_allocated = 0\u001b[m, \u001b[94msource_lot_id = NULL\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mki"]
[0.000, "o", "t_log_entries\u001b[m / build photos start\r\n\u001b[6Cfresh.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mShallow Copy Only (BOM Spec Text Only)\u001b[m: Cloning copies only the raw BOM text without preserving any \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m\r\n  links or schematic PDF attachments.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Copy BOM Lines with their \u001b[94;22mcomponent_id\u001b[39;1m links and reference docs, while resetting status, stock\u001b[?7h\u001b[110G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mallocations, and bench logs)\u001b[m—so building a second unit reuses all your part-matching work immediately. Does this\r\n  complete our shared understanding for this ticket?\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> sgtm\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(GLOSSARY-FORMAT.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(GLOSSARY.md, 02-bom-matching-stock-allocation-and-build-lifecycle.md, map.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  We have resolved \u001b[1m[\u001b[m\r\n⣾ "]
