[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29ASpecifically, should the workflow operate as a \u001b[1mtwo-step staged import\u001b[m:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mUpload & Column Mapping\u001b[m: Upload a CSV (or paste tabular text), choose a default target \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m (and\r\n  optional default supplier) for the batch, and map CSV columns (\u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m / Value, Category, Subtype,\u001b[K\r\n  Package/Footprint, Quantity, Storage Location path/name, Supplier, Supplier Part #, Datasheet URL, Notes) with\r\n  automatic header detection for common supplier exports and saved mapping presets.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mInteractive Staging & Reconciliation Preview\u001b[m: Before writing to the database, parse every row with the\r\n  deterministic spec parser and classify each row into one of three reconciliation states that the user can review or\r\n  override row-by-row (or in bulk):\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mExact Match\u001b[m (matches an existing \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m by \u001b[94msupplier + supplier_part_no\u001b[m or by normalized category +\r\n\u001b[6Celectrical value + package + key attributes): Default action is "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mAdd / Increment Stock Lot\u001b[m on the existing\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m at the target \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m (incrementing quantity if a lot at that location already exists, or\r\n\u001b[6Ccreating a new \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m if placed in a different location).\u001b[K\n\u001b[60D• \u001b[1mNear / Ambiguous Match\u001b[m (e.g., same category and \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m value, but the CSV omits wattage/tolerance or multiple\r\n\u001b[6Ccatalog \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m match): Highlighted for review so you can pick which existing \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m to add the \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cto, or choose \u001b[1mCreate as New Component\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[1mNo Match\u001b[m: Default action is \u001b[1mCreate New Component + Initial Stock Lot\u001b[m (auto-creating any new \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cin the path if requested).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes — use a two-step staged import (upload + column mapper with saved presets, followed by an interactive\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mreconciliation preview that auto-matches by supplier P/N or normalized parametric spec, defaults exact matc"]
[0.000, "o", "hes to\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1madding/incrementing a Stock Lot at the target Storage Location, and flags near matches for 1-click resolution).\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n⣾  \u001b[90mGenerating.\u001b[94m..\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /skills to browse and manage agent skills.\u001b[m\n\n\u001b[51D\u001b[?2026l"]
