[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AHow should the shopping list aggregator calculate net shortages and group lines across builds?\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mAggregate Demand Before Deducting Available Stock\u001b[m:\r\n      • For each \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m on the selected \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m that is not yet fully fulfilled (\u001b[94mFulfillment Status\u001b[m in\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m, or \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m, excluding \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m), compute its remaining unallocated\r\n\u001b[6Cdemand: \u001b[94munallocated_needed = quantity_required - quantity_allocated\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[68D• Group lines across all selected builds by linked \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m (or, for unlinked \u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m where \u001b[94mcomponent_id\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mIS NULL\u001b[m, group by normalized \u001b[94mcategory + canonical_value_display + package_or_mounting\u001b[m / \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C• Calculate \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m for each grouped part as:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;252mNet Shortfall = max(0, ∑ unallocated\\_needed - Available Stock)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;252m (where unlinked parts"]
[0.000, "o", " have `Available Stock = 0`).\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  2. \u001b[1mOptional Low-Stock Restock Toggle\u001b[m:\r\n      • Provide an optional \u001b[1m\"Include catalog low-stock restocking\"\u001b[m toggle that also pulls in any catalog \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cwhose post-build remaining stock (\u001b[94mAvailable Stock - sum(unallocated_needed)\u001b[m) would sit below its\u001b[K\n\u001b[96D\u001b[94mlow_stock_threshold\u001b[m, topping the recommended order quantity up to reach \u001b[94mlow_stock_threshold\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mBuild Breakdown Traceability\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Each aggregated shopping list row displays the total required across builds, current \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[1mNet\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mShortfall\u001b[m, and an expandable breakdown of which \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m and \u001b[94mreference_designators\u001b[m need that part.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes — aggregate \u001b[94;22munallocated_needed\u001b[39;1m across all selected Kit Builds (grouping linked lines by \u001b[94;22mcomponent_id\u001b[39;1m and\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1munlinked lines by normalized spec) before subtracting Available Stock, s"]
