[0.000, "o", "& Shopping List Export Workflows\u001b[39m](\u001b[38;2;181;188;197m./issues/03-csv-import-and-shopping-list-export-workflows.md\u001b[39m):\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mTwo-step staged CSV/paste import with column mapping presets and interactive exact/near/new match reconciliation\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mfor both Components/Stock Lots and Kit Build BOMs (with reference-designator category inference and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39midentical-spec row grouping), plus a live multi-build Shopping List that aggregates unallocated demand before\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39msubtracting Available Stock, supports low-stock restock top-ups, exports Full and Supplier Quick-Order\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mCSV/clipboard formats, and receives arrived lines directly into Stock Lots.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this chan"]
[0.000, "o", "ge\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
[3.475, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001bM\u001b[J\u001b[30A  Before exporting, each row lets you edit the \u001b[1mOrder Quantity\u001b[m (initialized to \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m, so you can easily bump\r\n  \u001b[94m1x\u001b[m resistor up to \u001b[94m10x\u001b[m or \u001b[94m50x\u001b[m for spares) and select/edit the target \u001b[94mSupplier\u001b[m and \u001b[94mSupplier Part #\u001b[m (pre-filled from\r\n  the linked \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m's existing \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m supplier metadata).\r\n  2. \u001b[1mExport Formats\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[14D• \u001b[1mFull Shopping List CSV\u001b[m: Exports all columns (\u001b[94mCategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSpec / Component Name\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPackage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSupplier\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSupplier\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mPart #\u001b[m, \u001b[94mAvailable Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mNet Shortfall\u001b[m, \u001b[94mOrder Quantity\u001b[m, \u001b[94mKit Builds & Reference Designators\u001b[m, \u001b[94mNotes\u001b[m), optionally\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K grouped or filtered by \u001b[94mSupplier\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[33D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mSupplier Quick-Order / Cart Format (CSV & Clipboard Copy)\u001b[m: Filters to a selected supplier (e.g., Mouser,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K DigiKey, Tayda, LCSC) and formats \u001b[94mSupplier Part #, Order Quantity, Custome"]
[0.000, "o", "r Reference (Kit Build names)\u001b[m for\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K direct paste or upload into supplier BOM/cart tools.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mClosing the Loop on Arrival\u001b[m: When parts arrive, you can either import the supplier's order CSV via the \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m& Stock Lot CSV Import\u001b[m workflow (Q1), or use a \u001b[1m\"Receive Selected Lines into Stock\"\u001b[m action directly from the\u001b[K\r\n  shopping list to create/increment \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m at a chosen \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m (auto-creating and linking catalog\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m for any previously unlinked \u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes — make the Shopping List a live computed view with editable Order Quantity and Supplier/Part # columns,\u001b[?7h\u001b[113G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1msupport both Full CSV export and per-supplier Quick-Order CSV/clipboard formats, and allow receiving lines directly\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1minto Stock Lots (or via supplier CSV import).\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────"]
