[0.000, "o", "configurable via \u001b[94;22m--data-dir\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mAUDIO_INVENTORY_DATA_DIR\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n\u001b[6C    • \u001b[94mdata/inventory.db\u001b[m (plus \u001b[94m.db-wal\u001b[m / \u001b[94m.db-shm\u001b[m) for the local \u001b[94mturso\u001b[m database.\u001b[K\n\u001b[67D\u001b[94mattachments/<kit_build_id>/<uuid>-<sanitized_filename>\u001b[m on disk, with metadata (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mkit_build_id\u001b[m,\r\n\t  \u001b[94mbench_log_entry_id\u001b[m, \u001b[94moriginal_filename\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmime_type\u001b[m, \u001b[94mrelative_path\u001b[m, \u001b[94msize_bytes\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcreated_at\u001b[m) tracked in an\u001b[K\r\n\t  \u001b[94mattachments\u001b[m table.\u001b[K\n\u001b[22D• \u001b[1mBackup & Restore\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[19D    • An in-app \u001b[1mExport Backup (\u001b[94;22m.zip\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m endpoint (\u001b[94mGET /settings/backup.zip\u001b[m) that checkpoints/reads a consistent\r\n\t  snapshot of \u001b[94minventory.db\u001b[m and bundles it with \u001b[94mdata/attachments/\u001b[m into a single \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m archive download.\u001b[K\r\n\t  • A \u001b[1mRestore / CLI backup\u001b[m workflow so moving machines or snapshotting before a big import is just copying or\r\n\t  unzipping one folder.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  2. \u001b[1mStore Attachments"]
[0.000, "o", " as SQL BLOBs inside \u001b[94;22minventory.db\u001b[m:\r\n      • Keeps everything in a single \u001b[94m.db\u001b[m file, though large PDF schematics and high-res bench photos bloat the\r\n\u001b[6Cdatabase file.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ **Use Option 1 **\u001b[?7h\u001b[23G\r\n⣾  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: To disable tips, toggle Show Tips in /settings.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
