[0.000, "o", "TTP Server, HTML Templating & Styling Stack\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m- **HTTP Server & Routing**: \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`axum`\u001b[39m (on \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`tokio`\u001b[39m) with \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`tower-http`\u001b[39m for static asset serving, multipart file\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39muploads (CSV imports and build attachments), and request tracing.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 26 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[5.033, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[30A\u001b[35D\u001b[1K \u001b[1mStatus\u001b[m state machine—enforcing the transactional invariants when transitioning between \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m (deducting/returning \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m quantities or auto-splitting on partial pick), \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cand \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m, plus 1-click kit build cloning.\n\u001b[53D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mimports\u001b[39;1m (Turso-backed module)\u001b[m: Owns the two-step staged CSV/paste workflow (\u001b[94mimport_batches\u001b[m / \u001b[94mimport_rows\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K column-mapping presets, identical-spec row grouping, and Exact / Near / New catalog reconciliation before\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K atomic commit.\u001b[K\n\u001b[15D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[39;1m (Turso-backed module)\u001b[m: Computes multi-build \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m (summing unallocated demand across\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K selected \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m before subtracting \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m, plus low-stock restock top-ups), generates supplier\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K quick-order CSV/paste strings, and receives arrived or"]
[0.000, "o", "ders into \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m.\n\u001b[76D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mweb\u001b[39;1m & \u001b[94;22mattachments\u001b[39;1m (HTTP / \u001b[94;22mmaud\u001b[39;1m / filesystem adapters)\u001b[m: Thin \u001b[94maxum\u001b[m route handlers and \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m view functions that\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K render full pages or targeted HTMX partials, plus local attachment file storage and \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m backup streaming.\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mTesting strategy\u001b[m: Integration and domain tests exercise \u001b[94mcatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbuilds\u001b[m, \u001b[94mimports\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[m directly\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K through their public module interfaces against ephemeral \u001b[94mturso::Builder::new_local(\":memory:\")\u001b[m instances with\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K real migrations applied (zero SQL mocks).\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mMulti-crate Cargo Workspace\u001b[m (splitting domain, db, and web into separate Cargo crates).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mUse Option 1 (a single Cargo binary+library crate with those 5 deep domain modules tested directly against in-\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mmemory \u001b[94;22mturso\u001b[39;1m instances, and a thin \u001b[94;22maxum\u001b[39;1m + \u001b"]
