[4.929, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[J\u001b[30A\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[1mStatus\u001b[m state machine—enforcing the transactional invariants when transitioning between \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m (deducting/returning \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m quantities or auto-splitting on partial pick), \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K and \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m, plus 1-click kit build cloning.\u001b[K\n\u001b[53D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mimports\u001b[39;1m (Turso-backed module)\u001b[m: Owns the two-step staged CSV/paste workflow (\u001b[94mimport_batches\u001b[m / \u001b[94mimport_rows\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K column-mapping presets, identical-spec row grouping, and Exact / Near / New catalog reconciliation before\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K atomic commit.\u001b[K\n\u001b[15D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[39;1m (Turso-backed module)\u001b[m: Computes multi-build \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m (summing unallocated demand across\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K selected \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m before subtracting \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m, plus low-stock restock top-ups), generates supplier\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K quick-order CSV/paste strings, and receives a"]
