[0.033, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A      \u001b[1mStatus\u001b[m state machine—enforcing the transactional invariants when transitioning between \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n      \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m (deducting/returning \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m quantities or auto-splitting on partial pick), \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n      and \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m, plus 1-click kit build cloning.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C• \u001b[94mimports\u001b[39;1m (Turso-backed module)\u001b[m: Owns the two-step staged CSV/paste workflow (\u001b[94mimport_batches\u001b[m / \u001b[94mimport_rows\u001b[m),\r\n\u001b[6Ccolumn-mapping presets, identical-spec row grouping, and Exact / Near / New catalog reconciliation before\r\n\u001b[6Catomic commit.\n\u001b[14D• \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[39;1m (Turso-backed module)\u001b[m: Computes multi-build \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m (summing unallocated demand across\r\n\u001b[6Cselected \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m before subtracting \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m, plus low-stock restock top-ups), generates supplier\r\n\u001b[6Cquick-order CSV/paste strings, and receives arrived orders into \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m.\n\u001b[75D"]
[0.000, "o", "• \u001b[94mweb\u001b[39;1m & \u001b[94;22mattachments\u001b[39;1m (HTTP / \u001b[94;22mmaud\u001b[39;1m / filesystem adapters)\u001b[m: Thin \u001b[94maxum\u001b[m route handlers and \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m view functions that\r\n\u001b[6Crender full pages or targeted HTMX partials, plus local attachment file storage and \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m backup streaming.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mTesting strategy\u001b[m: Integration and domain tests exercise \u001b[94mcatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbuilds\u001b[m, \u001b[94mimports\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[m directly\r\n\u001b[6Cthrough their public module interfaces against ephemeral \u001b[94mturso::Builder::new_local(\":memory:\")\u001b[m instances with\r\n\u001b[6Creal migrations applied (zero SQL mocks).\r\n  2. \u001b[1mMulti-crate Cargo Workspace\u001b[m (splitting domain, db, and web into separate Cargo crates).\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mUse Option 1 (a single Cargo binary+library crate with those 5 deep domain modules tested directly against in-\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mmemory \u001b[94;22mturso\u001b[39;1m instances, and a thin \u001b[94;22maxum\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mmaud\u001b[39;1m web layer)\u001b[m — does this complete our architecture p"]
