[0.000, "o", "s/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/04-rust-htmx-turso-crate-and-app-architecture.md\u0007Rust + HTMX + Local Turso Crate & App Architecture\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 is now resolved and recorded on the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1d38f6dd96fc9b3a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md\u0007Wayfinder Map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (and\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf07a4129f3cab16d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/docs/adr/0001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u00070001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 has been updated to reference the native \u001b[94mturso\u001b[m crate and \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Summary of Decisions Recorded\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWeb & HTML Stack\u001b[m: \u001b[94maxum\u001b[m + \u001b[94mtokio\u001b[m + \u001b[94mtower-http\u001b[m, compile-time \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m HTML functions for full pages and HTMX fragments,\r\n  and vendored \u001b[94mhtmx.min.js\u001b[m + standalone CSS with zero Node/npm build step.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDatabase & Migrations\u001b[m: Native Rust \u001b[9"]
[0.000, "o", "4mturso\u001b[m crate (\u001b[94mturso::Builder::new_local\u001b[m) with \u001b[94mPRAGMA foreign_keys = ON\u001b[m,\r\n  embedded \u001b[94mmigrations/*.sql\u001b[m auto-applied on startup, and parameterized SQL with a lightweight filter builder for\r\n  \u001b[94mjson_extract\u001b[m and recursive CTEs.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mData Directory & Backups\u001b[m: Unified \u001b[94mdata/\u001b[m directory (\u001b[94mdata/inventory.db\u001b[m + \u001b[94mdata/attachments/<kit_build_id>/...\u001b[m) with\r\n  a 1-click \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m backup download and restore workflow (resolving the attachment/backup item from \u001b[1mNot yet specified\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mDeep Module Architecture\u001b[m: Single Cargo package organized into 5 deep domain modules (\u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbuilds\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mimports\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[7D\u001b[?2026l"]
