[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  ➡️ \u001b[1mUse Option 1 (a single Cargo binary+library crate with those 5 deep domain modules tested directly against in-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[1mmemory \u001b[94;22mturso\u001b[39;1m instances, and a thin \u001b[94;22maxum\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mmaud\u001b[39;1m web layer)\u001b[m — does this complete our architecture picture?\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> sgtm\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 43.8s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 2 files \u001b[37m(03-csv-import-and-shopping-list-export-workflows.md, 05-core-ui-views-and-htmx-interaction-prot...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 2 files \u001b[37m(04-rust-htmx-turso-crate-and-app-architecture.md, map.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 13s\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7ea5c2eca3b11648;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_i"]
