[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m) with \u001b[94mPRAGMA foreign_keys = ON\u001b[m,\r\n  embedded \u001b[94mmigrations/*.sql\u001b[m auto-applied on startup, and parameterized SQL with a lightweight filter builder for\r\n  \u001b[94mjson_extract\u001b[m and recursive CTEs.\r\n  • \u001b[1mData Directory & Backups\u001b[m: Unified \u001b[94mdata/\u001b[m directory (\u001b[94mdata/inventory.db\u001b[m + \u001b[94mdata/attachments/<kit_build_id>/...\u001b[m) with\r\n  a 1-click \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m backup download and restore workflow (resolving the attachment/backup item from \u001b[1mNot yet specified\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mDeep Module Architecture\u001b[m: Single Cargo package organized into 5 deep domain modules (\u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbuilds\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mimports\u001b[m, \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[m) tested directly against in-memory \u001b[94m:memory:\u001b[m \u001b[94mturso\u001b[m instances, behind a thin \u001b[94mweb\u001b[m (\u001b[94maxum\u001b[m + \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m)\r\n  and\r\n⣾  \u001b[94mWorki\u001b[90mng...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /btw to ask a question without breaking context.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────"]
