[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[28A\u001b[47C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk34fd613ace8f3c48;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md\u0007map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9fafdaa9a51de24b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/05-core-ui-views-and-htmx-interaction-prototype.md\u0007Core UI Views & HTMX Interaction Prototype\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\u001b[45D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf44f681dcae5b389;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u0007prototype-ui.html\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K      live \u001b[1mComponent Catalog Search\u001b[m (right 40%) so clicking a BOM line's 🔍 button filters the catalog on the right\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m — \u001b[1mOverall Workbench Layout & Navigation Structure\u001b[m: After flipping through Variants\u001b[?7h\u001b[91G\n\n\n\n\u001b[88D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[28A\u001b[47C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk276104c45d2dbe90;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md\u0007map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk89ad4253a2d29873;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/05-core-ui-views-and-htmx-interaction-prototype.md\u0007Core UI Views & HTMX Interaction Prototype\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\u001b[45D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2b6d6e85d61ab061;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u0007prototype-ui.html\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K      live \u001b[1mComponent Catalog Search\u001b[m (right 40%) so clicking a BOM line's 🔍 button filters the catalog on the right\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m — \u001b[1mOverall Workbench Layout & Navigation Structure\u001b[m: After flipping through Variants A, B, and C\u001b[?7h\u001b[103G\r\n\n\n\n\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.033, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AI have claimed the next frontier ticket on the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1db3fce6f6d4833f;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md\u0007map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkffb9b63a312b03be;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/05-core-ui-views-and-htmx-interaction-prototype.md\u0007Core UI Views & HTMX Interaction Prototype\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** (\u001b[94mType:\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mprototype\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  I built a self-contained, interactive prototype in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk85b1930e3ab85e5c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u0007prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with \u001b[1m3 structurally different UI variants\u001b[m\r\n  switchable via the floating bottom bar (or \u001b[94m←\u001b[m / \u001b[94m→\u001b[m arrow keys and \u001b[94m?variant=A|B|C\u001b[m):\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOpen directly in your browser\u001b[m:\r\n    \u001b[38;5;252mopen .scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWhat you can test live across all 3 variants\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[1mVariant A (\u001b[94;22m?variant=A\u001b[39;1m — Dense Workbench Table + Slide-Over Inspector)\u001b[m: Top horizontal surface tabs (\u001b[94mComponent\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mKit Build BOM\u001b[m, \u001b[94mActive Bench Checklist\u001b[m) over full-width sticky data tables with a right-hand context\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cdrawer for multi-lot adjustments, 1-click BOM line splitting, and substitutions.\u001b[K\n\u001b[80D• \u001b[1mVariant B (\u001b[94;22m?variant=B\u001b[39;1m — Three-Pane Master-Detail IDE Workbench)\u001b[m: Persistent left tree (\u001b[94mStorage Locations\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Chierarchy and \u001b[94mKit Builds\u001b[m), compact center list, and persistent right inspector pane (\u001b[94mhx-target=\"#inspector\"\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mVariant C (\u001b[94;22m?variant=C\u001b[39;1m — Split-Screen Kitting Console + Bench HUD)\u001b[m: Side-by-side \u001b[1mKit Build BOM\u001b[m (left 60%) and\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K      live \u001b[1mComponent Catalog Search\u001b[m (right 40%) so clicking a BOM line's 🔍 button filters the catalog on the right\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K      for 1-click kitting/substitution, plus a dedicated \u001b[1mSoldering Bench HUD\u001b[m toggle.\u001b[?7h\u001b[85G\n\u001b[78D• \u001b[1mLive HTMX-style state interactions\u001b[m: Type shorthand like \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m or \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m into the search bar, click \u001b[94m+\u001b[m / \u001b[94m−\u001b[m on\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m, merge duplicate lots, click \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m / \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m / \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m status transitions on \u001b[1mBOM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mLines\u001b[m, split the \u001b[94mD1, D2\u001b[m germanium diode line, substitute \u001b[94mBAT41\u001b[m, or tap individual reference designators (\u001b[94m[R1]\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m[C3]\u001b[m) in the bench checklist.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ──────\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m — \u001b[1mOverall Workbench Layout & Navigation Structure\u001b[m: After flipping through Variants A, B, and C in [prototype-\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ui.html](f\u001b[?7h\u001b[13G\r\n⣽ \n\n\n\u001b[?2026l"]
