[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AI built a self-contained, interactive prototype in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8a2facb69284d541;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u0007prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with \u001b[1m3 structurally different UI variants\u001b[m\r\n  switchable via the floating bottom bar (or \u001b[94m←\u001b[m / \u001b[94m→\u001b[m arrow keys and \u001b[94m?variant=A|B|C\u001b[m):\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOpen directly in your browser\u001b[m:\r\n    \u001b[38;5;252mopen .scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWhat you can test live across all 3 variants\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[1mVariant A (\u001b[94;22m?variant=A\u001b[39;1m — Dense Workbench Table + Slide-Over Inspector)\u001b[m: Top horizontal surface tabs (\u001b[94mComponent\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mKit Build BOM\u001b[m, \u001b[94mActive Bench Checklist\u001b[m) over full-width sticky data tables with a right-hand context\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cdrawer for multi-lot adjustments, 1-click BOM line splitting, and substitutions.\u001b[K\n\u001b[80D• \u001b[1mVariant B (\u001b[94;22m?variant=B\u001b[39;1m —"]
[0.000, "o", " Three-Pane Master-Detail IDE Workbench)\u001b[m: Persistent left tree (\u001b[94mStorage Locations\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Chierarchy and \u001b[94mKit Builds\u001b[m), compact center list, and persistent right inspector pane (\u001b[94mhx-target=\"#inspector\"\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mVariant C (\u001b[94;22m?variant=C\u001b[39;1m — Split-Screen Kitting Console + Bench HUD)\u001b[m: Side-by-side \u001b[1mKit Build BOM\u001b[m (left 60%) and\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K      live \u001b[1mComponent Catalog Search\u001b[m (right 40%) so clicking a BOM line's 🔍 button filters the catalog on the right\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K      for 1-click kitting/substitution, plus a dedicated \u001b[1mSoldering Bench HUD\u001b[m toggle.\u001b[?7h\u001b[85G\n\u001b[78D• \u001b[1mLive HTMX-style state interactions\u001b[m: Type shorthand like \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m or \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m into the search bar, click \u001b[94m+\u001b[m / \u001b[94m−\u001b[m on\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m, merge duplicate lots, click \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m / \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m / \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m / \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m status transitions on \u001b[1mBOM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mLines\u001b[m, split the \u001b[94mD1, D2\u001b[m germanium diode line, substitute "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[94mBAT41\u001b[m, or tap individual reference designators (\u001b[94m[R1]\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m[C3]\u001b[m) in the bench checklist.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ──────\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m — \u001b[1mOverall Workbench Layout & Navigation Structure\u001b[m: After flipping through Variants A, B, and C in\u001b[?7h\u001b[106G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8a2fadb69284d6f4;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u0007prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, which primary layout paradigm (or hybrid of features from A, B, and C) feels right for the app?\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mVariant A (Full-Width Dense Workbench Table + Slide-Over Inspector Drawer)\u001b[m as the primary layout across\r\n  \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[9D\u001b[?2026l"]
