[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  I built a self-contained, interactive prototype in \u001b]8;id=jkf1a0f1a3e47a7007;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m-\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ with \u001b[1m3 structurally different UI variants\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  switchable via the floating bottom bar (or \u001b[94m←\u001b[m / \u001b[94m→\u001b[m arrow keys and \u001b[94m?variant=A|B|C\u001b[m):\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOpen directly in your browser\u001b[m:\n\u001b[30D\u001b[38;5;252mopen .scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mWhat you can test live across all 3 variants\u001b[m:\n\u001b[43D• \u001b[1mVariant A (\u001b[94;22m?variant=A\u001b[39;1m — Dense Workbench Table + Slide-Over Inspector)\u001b[m: Top horizontal surface tabs (\u001b[94mComponent\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mKit Build BOM\u001b[m, \u001b[94mActive Bench Checklist\u001b[m) over fu"]
[0.000, "o", "ll-width sticky data tables with a right-hand context\r\n\u001b[6Cdrawer for multi-lot adjustments, 1-click BOM line splitting, and substitutions.\n\u001b[80D• \u001b[1mVariant B (\u001b[94;22m?variant=B\u001b[39;1m — Three-Pane Master-Detail IDE Workbench)\u001b[m: Persistent left tree (\u001b[94mStorage Locations\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Chierarchy and \u001b[94mKit Builds\u001b[m), compact center list, and persistent right inspector pane (\u001b[94mhx-target=\"#inspector\"\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mVariant C (\u001b[94;22m?variant=C\u001b[39;1m — Split-Screen Kitting Console + Bench HUD)\u001b[m: Side-by-side \u001b[1mKit Build BOM\u001b[m (left 60%) and\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K      live \u001b[1mComponent Catalog Search\u001b[m (right 40%) so clicking a BOM line's 🔍 button filters the catalog on the right\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n\u001b[6Cfor 1-click kitting/substitution, plus a dedicated \u001b[1mSoldering Bench HUD\u001b[m toggle.\n\u001b[78D• \u001b[1mLive HTMX-style state interactions\u001b[m: Type shorthand like \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m or \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m into the search bar, click \u001b[94m+\u001b[m / \u001b[94m−\u001b[m on\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m, merge duplicate lots, click \u001b[94mUnalloca"]
