[0.500, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A  \u001b[94mscrolls the page behind it */\"\u001b[m / \u001b[94m\"DO read dialog.returnValue in a close listener to learn which button was used,\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mthen reset it with dialog.returnValue = ''.\"\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  • \u001b[94mdark-mode\u001b[m: Declared \u001b[94m<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\u001b[m and \u001b[94m:root { color-scheme: light dark; }\u001b[m,\r\n  pairing \u001b[94mlight-dark()\u001b[m color tokens with a \u001b[94m@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)\u001b[m fallback so native scrollbars, form\r\n  controls, and surfaces adapt without flashes (\u001b[94m\"/* MANDATORY: Apply color-scheme to :root or html for viewport-wide\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mtheming */\"\u001b[m / \u001b[94m\"/* MANDATORY: Fallback for browsers without light-dark support */\"\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[94mbrand-consistent-forms\u001b[m: Applied high-contrast light/dark \u001b[94maccent-color\u001b[m tokens to native form controls and\r\n  progressive-enhancement fallback styles guarded by \u001b[94m@supports not (accent-color: var(--brand-color))\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"You MUST use\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mthe @supports not rule to apply cust"]
[0.000, "o", "om fallback styles only when accent-color is not supported.\"\u001b[m).\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> please open the prototype in a browser\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(open /Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/aud...)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  I've opened \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk72a5b73a19e98ba5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/prototype-ui.html\u0007prototype-ui.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 in your default browser.\r\n\n  You can switch between \u001b[1mVariant A\u001b[m, \u001b[1mVariant B\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mVariant C\u001b[m using the floating pill bar at the bottom of the screen\r\n  (or the \u001b[94m←\u001b[m and \u001b[94m→\u001b[m arrow keys), and click through the \u001b[1mCatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[1mKit Build BOM\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mBench Checklist\u001b[m views.\r\n\n  Once you've had a chance to click around:\u001b[?7l\r\n"]
