[0.068, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 13s, 477 tokens\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m — \u001b[1mParametric Search Feedback & Multi-Lot Stock Adjustment in the Catalog Table\u001b[m: In Variant A's \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mCatalog\u001b[m view, how should live HTMX filtering and inline \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m steppers behave?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  1. \u001b[1mDebounced HTMX Search (\u001b[94;22mdelay:150ms\u001b[39;1m) + Live Parsed Spec Badge + Single-Lot Inline Stepper / Multi-Lot Inspector\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mDrawer\u001b[m:\n\b\b\b• Typing in the search bar (\u001b[94mhx-get=\"/catalog\" hx-trigger=\"input changed delay:150ms\" hx-push-url=\"true\"\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cupdates the table and displays the live \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[39;1m interpretation badge\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94mValue: 4.7kΩ (4700 Ω) ·\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mTolerance: 1%\u001b[m) so you can immediately see how shorthand like \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m or \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m was normalized, alongside dynamic\r\n\u001b[6Ccategory-specific attribute filters when a category is selected.\n\u001b[64D• Rows with a \u001b[1msingle Stock Lot\u001b[m render an inline \u001b[94m− / qty / +\u001b[m s"]
[0.000, "o", "tepper directly in the table cell (\u001b[94mhx-post\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cswapping just that \u001b[94m<tr>\u001b[m), while rows with \u001b[1mmultiple Stock Lots\u001b[m render a \u001b[94m\"2 Stock Lots (57) ▸\"\u001b[m button that\r\n\u001b[6Ctargets the right-hand Inspector Drawer for per-location \u001b[94m− / +\u001b[m adjustments and 1-click \u001b[1mMerge Lots\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mInline Steppers for Every Lot Inside the Table Cell\u001b[m: Stack a separate \u001b[94m− / qty / +\u001b[m stepper for every \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m directly inside the table row even when a component has 3+ lots.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mDrawer-Only Adjustments\u001b[m: Never put \u001b[94m− / +\u001b[m steppers in the table row; require clicking into the right-hand\r\n  Inspector Drawer for all quantity changes.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mRecommendation: Option 1 (Debounced HTMX search with live \u001b[94;22mspec_parser\u001b[39;1m token feedback, inline \u001b[94;22m− / +\u001b[39;1m stepper for\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1msingle-lot components, and right-hand Inspector Drawer for multi-lot components and lot merging).\u001b[m Most components\r\n  live in a sing"]
