[0.000, "o", "sitions + Out-of-Band Readiness Summary + Per-Designator Bench Chips\u001b[m:\n\u001b[87D• \u001b[1mKit Build BOM Tab\u001b[m: Each \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m \u001b[94m<tr>\u001b[m has inline 1-click \u001b[1mFulfillment Status\u001b[m pills (\u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m, \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m) that swap the row via \u001b[94mhx-patch\u001b[m and update the build's readiness counter via \u001b[94mhx-swap-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94moob=\"true\"\u001b[m, paired with top-level \u001b[1mBatch Kitting Actions\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"Reserve All Available\"\u001b[m and \u001b[94m\"Pick All Reserved to\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mProject Box\"\u001b[m). Clicking a row loads the right-hand \u001b[1mInspector Drawer\u001b[m for \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m selection, candidate\r\n\u001b[6Cmatching for \u001b[94mUnlinked\u001b[m lines, \u001b[1m1-Click Split BOM Line\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mSubstitute Catalog Component\u001b[m (via the native \u001b[94m<dialog>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cmodal).\n\u001b[7D• \u001b[1mActive Bench Checklist Tab\u001b[m: Groups \u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m by assembly profile height (\u001b[94mStage 1: Low-Profile Resistors &\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDiodes\u001b[m, \u001b[94mStage 2: IC Sockets & Film Capacitors\u001b[m, \u001b[94mStag"]
