[0.000, "o", "tal surface navigation.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mComponent Catalog & Parametric Search\u001b[m: Debounced HTMX search (\u001b[94mdelay:150ms\u001b[m) with a live \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m interpretation\r\n  badge (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m → \u001b[94mValue: 4.7kΩ (4700 Ω)\u001b[m), dynamic category-specific \u001b[94mspecs_json\u001b[m filters, inline \u001b[94m− / qty / +\u001b[m steppers for\u001b[K\r\n  single-lot \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m, and right-hand Inspector Drawer controls for multi-lot \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m and 1-click \u001b[1mMerge\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mDuplicate Stock Lots\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mKit Build BOM & Allocation\u001b[m: Row-level HTMX \u001b[1mFulfillment Status\u001b[m transitions (\u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m) with \u001b[94mhx-swap-oob\u001b[m readiness counters, top-level batch kitting actions, and right-hand Inspector Drawer\r\n  actions for \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m selection, \u001b[1m1-Click Split BOM Line\u001b[m, and native \u001b[94m<dialog>\u001b[m component substitution preserving\r\n  \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mActive Bench Checklist\u001b[m: Stage-grouped assembly rows (\u001b[94m"]
