[1.381, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[25A\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mWorkbench Layout (Variant A)\u001b[m: Full-width dense sticky data tables paired with a 340px right-hand context\r\n  \u001b[1mInspector Drawer\u001b[m (\u001b[94mhx-target=\"#inspector\"\u001b[m) and top horizontal surface navigation.\n\u001b[78D\u001b[1mComponent Catalog & Parametric Search\u001b[m: Debounced HTMX search (\u001b[94mdelay:150ms\u001b[m) with a live \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m interpretation\r\n  badge (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m → \u001b[94mValue: 4.7kΩ (4700 Ω)\u001b[m), dynamic category-specific \u001b[94mspecs_json\u001b[m filters, inline \u001b[94m− / qty / +\u001b[m steppers for\r\n  single-lot \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m, and right-hand Inspector Drawer controls for multi-lot \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m and 1-click \u001b[1mMerge\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mDuplicate Stock Lots\u001b[m.\n\u001b[19D\u001b[1mKit Build BOM & Allocation\u001b[m: Row-level HTMX \u001b[1mFulfillment Status\u001b[m transitions (\u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m) with \u001b[94mhx-swap-oob\u001b[m readiness counters, top-level batch kitting actions, and right-hand Inspector Drawer\u001b[K\r\n  actions for \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m s"]
