[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29ABased on the resolved design and prototype issues in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk23a9dfa87a75e888;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md\u0007map.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf5f52921c2b6ffd3;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/04-rust-htmx-turso-crate-and-app-architecture.md\u000704-rust-htmx-turso-crate-and-app-architecture.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007),\r\n  here is the proposed testing seam before I write and publish the full specification:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Proposed Testing Seam\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  We will test the application at \u001b[1mone primary boundary\u001b[m: the \u001b[1mpublic Rust API of the deep domain modules\u001b[m (\u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mcatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbuilds\u001b[m, \u001b[94mimports\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[m) backed by an ephemeral, in-memory local Turso database\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94mturso::Builder::new_local(\":memory:\")\u001b[m) with the real embedded SQL migrations applied—using zero SQL mocks.\r\n\u001b[K\n  •"]
[0.000, "o", " \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[39;1m (pure functional boundary)\u001b[m: Tested directly via \u001b[94mparse_spec(raw_text, category_hint)\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94minfer_category_from_designators(designators)\u001b[m across shorthand values (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m47n\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100kA\u001b[m, \u001b[94mB50k\u001b[m), tolerances,\r\n  wattages, voltages, and reference designator strings.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mTurso-backed domain modules (\u001b[94;22mcatalog\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mbuilds\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mimports\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mshopping_list\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Exercised together through their public\r\n  Rust module interfaces against \u001b[94m:memory:\u001b[m Turso instances to verify external behavior end-to-end:\u001b[K\r\n      • Hierarchical \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m moves and recursive breadcrumb updates.\u001b[K\r\n\t\u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m parametric filtering (\u001b[94mspecs_json\u001b[m), multi-location \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m adjustments, \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Ccalculation, and automatic lot merging when moving/receiving stock into an existing \u001b[94m(component_id, location_id)\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m lifecy"]
[0.000, "o", "cle transitions, \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m auto-matching, the 5-state \u001b[1mFulfillment Status\u001b[m state machine\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m with \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m deduction and return, \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m including per-designator\r\n\u001b[6Cbench placement completion, \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m), 1-click \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m splitting, component substitutions preserving\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m cloning.\u001b[K\n\u001b[37D• Two-step staged CSV/paste imports with designator grouping and \u001b[94mExact\u001b[m / \u001b[94mNear\u001b[m / \u001b[94mNo Match\u001b[m catalog reconciliation\r\n\u001b[6Cprior to atomic commit.\u001b[K\n\u001b[23D• Multi-build \u001b[1mShopping List\u001b[m aggregation, \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m math (including low-stock restock top-ups), supplier CSV\r\n\u001b[6Cexport generation, and receiving arrived lines directly into \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mThin HTTP/HTML & Backup Smoke Seam\u001b[m: Because \u001b[94maxum\u001b[m handlers and \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m views are thin adapters over those domain\r\n  modules, o\u001b[K\n\n\n\u001b[10D\u001b[?2026l"]
