[0.000, "o", "7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Problem Statement\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mA hobbyist audio electronics builder who builds guitar pedals, synthesizer modules, and amplifiers accumulates\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mhundreds or thousands of electronic **Components** stored across nested physical containers (crates, bags,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mboxes, binders, and drawers), with duplicate stashes of the same part frequently living in multiple\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mcontainers. At the same time, the builder tracks multiple **Kit Builds** across different stages—from\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mwishlisted schematics to active kitting and bench debugging.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mWithout a purpose-built tool, the builder faces several re"]
[0.000, "o", "curring friction points:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. **Inconsistent electrical shorthand and parametric search**: Schematics, supplier invoices, and personal\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mspreadsheets write the same value in incompatible ways (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4k7`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4.7kΩ`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4700R`\u001b[39m, or \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`0.047uF`\u001b[39m vs. \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`47nF`\u001b[39m vs.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`47n`\u001b[39m), making text-only search unreliable while rigid forms lose nuances from the original specification\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mstring (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`100kA 16mm PCB`\u001b[39m or \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4k7 1% 1/4W Metal Film`\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 207 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[158.341, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[31A  • \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[39;1m (pure functional boundary)\u001b[m: Tested directly via \u001b[94mparse_spec(raw_text, category_hint)\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94minfer_category_from_designators(designators)\u001b[m across shorthand values (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.047uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m47n\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100kA\u001b[m, \u001b[94mB50k\u001b[m), tolerances,\u001b[K\r\n  wattages, voltages, and reference designator strings.\r\n  • \u001b[1mTurso-backed domain modules (\u001b[94;22mcatalog\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mbuilds\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mimports\u001b[39;1m, \u001b[94;22mshopping_list\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Exercised together through their public\r\n  Rust module interfaces against \u001b[94m:memory:\u001b[m Turso instances to verify external behavior end-to-end:\u001b[K\n\u001b[92D\u001b[1K • Hierarchical \u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m moves and recursive breadcrumb updates.\u001b[K\n\u001b[72D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m parametric filtering (\u001b[94mspecs_json\u001b[m), multi-location \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m adjustments, \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K calculation, and automatic lot merging when moving/receiving stock into an existing \u001b[94m(component_id"]
[0.000, "o", ", location_id)\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m lifecycle transitions, \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m auto-matching, the 5-state \u001b[1mFulfillment Status\u001b[m state machine\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K (\u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m with \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m deduction and return, \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m including per-designator\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K bench placement completion, \u001b[94mIncluded in Kit\u001b[m), 1-click \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m splitting, component substitutions preserving\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m cloning.\u001b[K\n\u001b[38D\u001b[1K • Two-step staged CSV/paste imports with designator grouping and \u001b[94mExact\u001b[m / \u001b[94mNear\u001b[m / \u001b[94mNo Match\u001b[m catalog reconciliation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K prior to atomic commit.\u001b[K\n\u001b[24D\u001b[1K • Multi-build \u001b[1mShopping List\u001b[m aggregation, \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m math (including low-stock restock top-ups), supplier CSV\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K export generation, and receiving arrived lines directly into \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mThin HTTP/HTML & Backup Smoke Seam\u001b[m: Because \u001b[94maxum\u001b[m handle"]
[0.000, "o", "rs and \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m views are thin adapters over those domain\u001b[K\r\n  modules, only lightweight \u001b[94mtower::ServiceExt::oneshot\u001b[m smoke tests are needed for full-page vs. \u001b[94mHX-Request\u001b[m partial\u001b[K\r\n  rendering (including \u001b[94mhx-swap-oob\u001b[m headers) and \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m backup/restore round-trips against a temporary directory.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Does this testing seam match your expectations before I write the full spec and publish it to the issue tracker?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> go ahead\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(spec.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⣯  \u001b[90mEditi\u001b[94mng fi\u001b[90mles...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
