[27.520, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\n  I have synthesized and published the specification with the \u001b[94mready-for-agent\u001b[m triage label to the local issue\r\n  tracker:\u001b[K\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mFull Specification\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkddebc1242865f3ba;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u0007spec.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mIssue Tracker Entry\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk18d5c8c1f27718f1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/06-audio-electronics-inventory-and-kit-build-spec.md\u000706-audio-electronics-inventory-and-kit-build-spec.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  • \u001b[1mUpdated Map\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk11057e6ca0f62f59;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/map.md\u0007map.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Summary of What's Included\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mProblem Statement & Solution\u001b[m: Frames the hobbyist builder's pain points and the local-first Rust (\u001b[94maxum\u001b[m + \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m +\r\n  HTMX"]
[0.000, "o", " + local \u001b[94mturso\u001b[m) workbench solution using strict \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc0a4d416f340240b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 terminology and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk228cbba6c1207777;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/docs/adr/0001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u00070001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1m42 User Stories\u001b[m: Covers the 9 \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m categories, shorthand electrical parsing with verbatim \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m\r\n  preservation, recursive \u001b[1mStorage Locations\u001b[m, multi-location \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m and lot merging, \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m, \u001b[1mBOM Line\u001b[m auto-\r\n  matching, the 5-state \u001b[1mFulfillment Status\u001b[m machine, substitutions, 1-click line splitting, \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m cloning, the\r\n  Active Bench Checklist with per-designator soldering chips, \u001b[1mBench Log Entries\u001b[m, staged CSV imports, live multi-build\r\n  \u001b[1mShopping List\u001b[m aggregation & \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m math, order receiving, and"]
[0.000, "o", " \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m backup/restore.\r\n  • \u001b[1mImplementation & Testing Decisions\u001b[m: Documents the 5 deep domain modules (\u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcatalog\u001b[m, \u001b[94mbuilds\u001b[m, \u001b[94mimports\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mshopping_list\u001b[m) and the \u001b[94m:memory:\u001b[m Turso testing seam.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m /\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b"]
