[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AHere is the proposed breakdown of \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8b1fab4aa352cb33;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u0007spec.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into \u001b[1m8 tracer-bullet vertical slices\u001b[m, using the domain language from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9cff95204b271a3a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and architecture in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3127665edad41f18;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/docs/adr/0001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u00070001-rust-htmx-turso-stack.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mWorkspace Foundation, Spec Parser & Hierarchical Storage Locations\u001b[m\r\n      • \u001b[1mBlocked by\u001b[m: None (can start immediately)\u001b[K\r\n\t\u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: Bootstraps the single-binary Rust server (\u001b[94maxum\u001b[m + \u001b[94mmaud\u001b[m + embedded \u001b[94mturso\u001b[m SQLite with startup\r\n\u001b[6Cmigrations and vendored \u001b[94mhtmx.min.js\u001b[m/CSS), implements the deterministic \u001b[94mspec_p"]
[0.000, "o", "arser\u001b[m (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m → \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m / \u001b[94m4700 Ω\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m047uF\u001b[m → \u001b[94m47nF\u001b[m, taper/tolerance/wattage/package extraction, and reference-designator category inference), and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cdelivers end-to-end management of self-referential \u001b[1mStorage Locations\u001b[m (\u001b[94mCrate\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBinder\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDrawer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mBag\u001b[m, \u001b[94mOther\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cwhere creating or moving a container updates nested breadcrumb paths across the workbench shell.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mComponent Catalog, Parametric Search & Multi-Lot Stock Adjustments\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mBlocked by\u001b[m: #1 (Workspace Foundation, Spec Parser & Hierarchical Storage Locations)\r\n\t\u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: End-to-end \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m and \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m management across the 9 audio electronics categories:\r\n\u001b[6Cadding \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m with shorthand normalization + verbatim \u001b[94mraw_spec_text\u001b[m preservation, debounced HTMX search\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mdelay:150ms\u001b[m) with a live \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m interpretation badge, dynamic catego"]
