[0.000, "o", " **Available Stock** to compute **Net\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mShortfall**, an optional **\"Include catalog low-stock restocking\"** toggle, expandable per-build and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mreference-designator traceability, inline overrides for \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Order Quantity`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Supplier`\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Supplier Part #`\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m**Full Shopping List CSV** and **Supplier Quick-Order CSV / Clipboard** exports, and 1-click **\"Receive\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mSelected Lines into Stock\"** when orders arrive.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Blocked by:** 03: Kit Builds, BOM Line Auto-Matching & 5-State Stock Fulfillment\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Status:** ready-for-agent\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m- [ ] Selecting any combination of **Kit Builds** on the **Shopping List** view aggregates every non-kit **BOM\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mLine** (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`fulfillment_status NOT IN ('Included in Kit', 'Installed', 'Picked')`\u001b[39m) with\u001b[K\u001b[m\n\u001b[89D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m$\\text{unallocated\\_needed} = \\max(0, \\text{quantity\\_required} - \\text{quantity\\_allocated})$, grouping across\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mall selected builds by \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`component_id`\u001b[39m when linked or by normalized \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`(category, canonical_value_display,\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123mpackage_or_mounting)`\u001b[39m when unlinked, and computes **Net Shortfall** across the combined demand before\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39msubtracting **Available Stock**:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52"]
[0.000, "o", ";15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m  $$\\text{Net Shortfall} = \\max\\left(0, \\sum \\text{unallocated\\_needed} - \\text{Available Stock}\\right)$$\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 5 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
