[0.000, "o", "52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 3 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**What to build:** End-to-end backup and restore of the unified local data directory (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`inventory.db`\u001b[39m and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`attachments/`\u001b[39m), allowing the builder to download a consistent \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`.zip`\u001b[39m archive snapshot in one click from the\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mweb UI (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`GET /settings/backup.zip`\u001b[39m) and restore an existing \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`.zip`\u001b[39m backup archive into the data directory via\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mthe UI or CLI.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Blocked by:** 05: Active Bench Checklist, Build Attachments & Bench Log Entries\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Status:** ready-for-agent\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m- [ ] Clicking **Download Backup (`.zip`)** (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`GET /settings/backup.zip`\u001b[39m) streams a valid \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`.zip`\u001b[39m archive\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mcontaining a consistent snapshot of the SQLite database (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`inventory.db`\u001b[39m) and all uploaded build attachment\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mfiles under \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`attachments/<kit_build_id>/`\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m- [ ] Restoring from a \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`.zip`\u001b[39m backup archive (via the settings restore upload or CLI restore command) validates\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mthe archive structure and restores both \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`inventory.db`\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`attachments/`\u001b[39m into the configured data directory\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m(\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`--"]
