[0.916, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[30A  7. \u001b[1mLive Multi-Build Shopping List, Supplier Quick-Order Exports & Order Receiving\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[78D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mBlocked by\u001b[m: #3 (Kit Builds, BOM Line Auto-Matching & 5-State Stock Fulfillment)\u001b[K\n\u001b[81D• \u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: The live \u001b[1mShopping List\u001b[m view that aggregates unfulfilled demand across any selected set of\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b[m before subtracting \u001b[1mAvailable Stock\u001b[m to compute \u001b[1mNet Shortfall\u001b[m, an \u001b[1m\"Include catalog low-stock\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[1mrestocking\"\u001b[m top-up toggle, expandable per-build/designator traceability, inline overrides for \u001b[94mOrder Quantity\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mSupplier\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mSupplier Part #\u001b[m, \u001b[1mFull Shopping List CSV\u001b[m and \u001b[1mSupplier Quick-Order CSV / Clipboard\u001b[m exports, and 1-\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K click \u001b[1m\"Receive Selected Lines into Stock\"\u001b[m (creating/incrementing \u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m and auto-creating/linking catalog\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m for unlinked \u001b[1mBOM Lines\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  8. \u001b[1mUnified Data Directory \u001b[94;22m.zip\u001b[39;1m"]
