[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[31A  Ticket 06 Merger is running \u001b[94mcargo test\u001b[m right now, and Ticket 05 Implementer (\u001b[94m855525da-03aa-46d6-b746-8b8dec80d5d9\u001b[m)\r\n  is waiting on user approval for an \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m call. I will wait for Ticket 06 Merger to finish.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Please also approve the pending \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m prompt on \u001b[94mTicket 05 Implementer\u001b[m (\u001b[94m855525da-03aa-46d6-b746-8b8dec80d5d9\u001b[m) if\r\n  shown in the UI.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mScheduled\u001b[m 1 timer \u001b[37m(10s: Check if Ticket 06 Merger has finished.)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Ticket 06 (\u001b[94m06-staged-csv-and-clipboard-imports.md\u001b[m) is now merged into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m (\u001b[94m8548bb5\u001b[m) with 31\r\n  passing tests!\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Let's check on Ticket 05 (\u001b[94m855525da-03aa-46d6-b746-8b8dec80d5d9\u001b[m). Why is it \u001b[94mwaiting_for_input\u001b[m on \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m? Because\r\n  \u001b[94m.scratch/\u001b[m is a dot-directory (\u001b[94m/.scratch/\u001b[m), so \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m inside \u001b[94m/tmp/audio-inventory-wt/ticket-05/.scratch/...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  tri"]
[0.000, "o", "ggers a user approval prompt! Let's check \u001b[94mgit status\u001b[m inside \u001b[94m/tmp/audio-inventory-wt/ticket-05\u001b[m to see what \u001b[94mTicket\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m05 Implementer\u001b[m has already built.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git -C /tmp/audio-inventory-wt/ticket-05 status ; git -C /tmp/audio-inventory-wt/ticket...)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Aha! Look at \u001b[94mticket-05\u001b[m:\r\n  \u001b[94mcd7d64f (HEAD -> ticket-05) feat(05): implement active bench checklist, attachments, and bench log entries\u001b[m!\r\n  Ticket 05 Implementer ALREADY committed \u001b[94mcd7d64f\u001b[m (\u001b[94mfeat(05): implement active bench checklist, attachments, and bench\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mlog entries\u001b[m), and was in the middle of merging \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m into \u001b[94mticket-05\u001b[m!\u001b[K\r\n  Let's check if \u001b[94mTicket 05 Implementer\u001b[m is still running or waiting for input. Let's list subagents.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mMessaging\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⣽  \u001b[94mM\u001b[90managing subagents...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────"]
