[0.032, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[26ATickets 04, 06, and 07 are now merged into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m (\u001b[94m8548bb5\u001b[m). Ticket 05 (\u001b[94m05-active-bench-checklist-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mattachments-and-bench-logs.md\u001b[m) is running its post-merge test suite and will complete shortly.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mMessaged\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Ticket 05 Implementer is finishing up. I will wait for its notification.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mScheduled\u001b[m 1 timer \u001b[37m(10s: Check if Ticket 05 Implementer has finished.)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Let's check subagents now.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mMessaged\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Look at \u001b[94mTicket 05 Implementer\u001b[m (\u001b[94m855525da-03aa-46d6-b746-8b8dec80d5d9\u001b[m): let's see what commits already exist on\r\n  \u001b[94mticket-05\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git -C /tmp/audio-inventory-wt/ticket-05 log -n 4 --oneline ; git -C /tmp/audio-invento...)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Look at \u001b[94mticket-05\u001b[m:\r\n  \u001b[94mfb7f6bc (HEA"]
[0.000, "o", "D -> ticket-05) Merge branch 'feat/audio-inventory' into ticket-05\u001b[m!\r\n  It already merged \u001b[94m5fa521a\u001b[m (\u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m after Ticket 07) into \u001b[94mticket-05\u001b[m at \u001b[94mfb7f6bc\u001b[m, and then started a\r\n  second merge when Ticket 06 landed (\u001b[94m8548bb5\u001b[m)!\u001b[K\r\n  Let's check if \u001b[94mTicket 05 Implementer\u001b[m is still running now that the command was approved. Let's list subagents.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mMessaging\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⣯  \u001b[90mRunning command\u001b[94m...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────"]
