[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[26A  Ticket 05 (\u001b[94m05-active-bench-checklist-attachments-and-bench-logs.md\u001b[m) has completed and merged \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  into \u001b[94mticket-05\u001b[m. I have launched the Ticket 05 Merger subagent to fast-forward \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m to \u001b[94mdd11968\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n  after which Ticket 08 (\u001b[94m08-unified-data-directory-zip-backup-and-restore.md\u001b[m) will be unblocked.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[1;33mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(\u001b[m\u001b[37m08-unified-data-directory-zip-backup-and-restore.md\u001b[m\u001b[37m)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git add .scratch/audio-inventory/issues/08-unified-data-directory-zip-backup-and-restore.md && git commit -m...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mSpawned\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Tickets 01 through 07 are now merged and \u001b[94mresolved\u001b[m on \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m with all 36 tests passing. I have claimed\r\n  Ticket 08 (\u001b[94m08-unified-data-directory-zip-backup-and-restore.md\u001b[m) and launched an implementer subagent in worktree\r\n  \u001b[94mticket-0"]
[0.000, "o", "8\u001b[m. Once Ticket 08 completes and merges, I will run the two-axis \u001b[94mcode-review\u001b[m across the integration branch.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mSpawned\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Ticket 08 (\u001b[94m08-unified-data-directory-zip-backup-and-restore.md\u001b[m) implementation is complete. I have launched the\r\n  Ticket 08 Merger subagent to merge \u001b[94mticket-08\u001b[m into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m, after which I will run the two-axis \u001b[94mcode-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mreview\u001b[m across the full \u001b[94mmain...feat/audio-inventory\u001b[m diff.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git rev-parse main && git log main..HEAD --oneline)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Let's wait a moment for the Ticket 08 Merger subagent (\u001b[94mefe5e8a6-67ac-417b-8706-fa34d14562a3\u001b[m) to finish merging\r\n  \u001b[94mticket-08\u001b[m. Let's check its status.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mMessaged\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[94mself\u001b[m needs approval for \u001b[33;1mBash\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[90m───────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m\n\b\u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mBash\u001b[37;22m(cargo test && git rev-parse HEAD)\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m\n\b\u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mctrl+k\u001b[m approve · \u001b[33;1malt+j\u001b[m manage\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
