[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[25A      • \u001b[94m/Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.agents/skills/codebase-design/SKILL.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • Plus the Fowler code smell baseline from \u001b[94m.agents/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  4. Spawn both \u001b[1mStandards\u001b[m and \u001b[1mSpec\u001b[m sub-agents in parallel with fresh context windows! Let's invoke both now.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mSpawned\u001b[m 2 subagents \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  All 8 tickets (\u001b[94m01\u001b[m through \u001b[94m08\u001b[m) are now merged onto \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m (\u001b[94mb92ba8a\u001b[m) and marked \u001b[94mresolved\u001b[m. I have\r\n  launched the two parallel \u001b[94mcode-review\u001b[m subagents (\u001b[1mStandards\u001b[m and \u001b[1mSpec\u001b[m axes) and will fix any issues raised once they\r\n  report back.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mScheduled\u001b[m 1 timer \u001b[37m(10s: Check if Standards subagent has also completed.)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Waiting for both Code Review subagents to complete.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mMessaged\u001b[m 1 subagent \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Both"]
[0.000, "o", " Code Review subagents are actively reading files. I will end my turn and wait for them to report back.\r\n\n  The \u001b[1mStandards\u001b[m axis review subagent has returned its findings. I am now waiting for the \u001b[1mSpec\u001b[m axis review subagent\r\n  (\u001b[94mee6bf12d-0bc3-4ff7-82ae-e56d6287dd08\u001b[m) to finish so I can aggregate both reports and fix all identified issues in a\r\n  fresh implementer subagent.\r\n\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mScheduling\u001b[m 1 timer \u001b[37m(10s: Check if Spec review subagent has completed.)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Waiting for the Spec axis review sub\r\n⢿  \u001b[94mSche\u001b[90mduling...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Press ctrl+g to open an external editor for long prompts.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
