[2.926, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27A\u001b[1m## Spec\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[39;1m (Soldered) Parts Refunded on Line Transitions (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:64, 151\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m parts are permanently\r\n  consumed per spec, but \u001b[94mtransition_bom_line_status\u001b[m, \u001b[94msplit_bom_line\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlink_bom_line_component\u001b[m, and\r\n  \u001b[94msubstitute_bom_line_component\u001b[m treated \u001b[94m\"Installed\"\u001b[m like \u001b[94m\"Picked\"\u001b[m and refunded stock (or fabricated stock if\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m was \u001b[94mNULL\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mStaged Import Batch Commits Atomicity (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:119, 198\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: \u001b[94mcommit_component_import_batch\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94mcommit_bom_import_batch\u001b[m executed row mutations outside an atomic transaction/rollback guard.\r\n  • \u001b[1mInline BOM Status \u001b[94;22mhx-patch\u001b[39;1m Attribute (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:175\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Inline BOM status buttons emitted \u001b[94mhx-post\u001b[m instead of \u001b[94mhx-patch\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mUbiquitous Language & \u001b[94;22mattachments\u001b[39;1m Adapter Module (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:122, 218\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Table \u001b[94m"]
[0.001, "o", "kit_log_entries\u001b[m vs. \u001b[94mbench_log_entries\u001b[m\r\n  and missing \u001b[94msrc/attachments.rs\u001b[m adapter module.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1mSummary\u001b[m: 4 findings on Standards (worst: \u001b[94mkit_log_entries\u001b[m table name vs. \u001b[94mGLOSSARY.md\u001b[m \u001b[1mBench Log Entry\u001b[m), 4 findings on\r\n  Spec (worst: \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m parts being refunded to stock instead of staying permanently consumed).\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have launched a single fresh implementer subagent (\u001b[94mCode Review Fixer Implementer\u001b[m) in \u001b[94m/tmp/audio-inventory-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mwt/ticket-review-fixes\u001b[m to fix all of these issues, after which I will merge it into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m and clean\r\n  up all worktrees.\u001b[K\r\n\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[94mself\u001b[m needs approval for \u001b[33;1mBash\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m\n\b\u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mBash\u001b[37;22m(cd /tmp/audio-inventory-wt/ticket-review-fixes && rg -n\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[37m\"kit_log_entries|category_or_type|external_urls_json|checked_designators_json\" src/ migrations/ tests/)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\b\u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mctrl+k\u001b[m approve · \u001b[33;1malt+j\u001b[m manage\n\n\n\n\t\t\u001b[38;5;214mBlocked\u001b[m · Bash\u001b[90m · 1m5s\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2A\u001b[67D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.019, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A      • \u001b[94mjson_str_attr\u001b[m and \u001b[94mjson_f64_attr\u001b[m are duplicated across \u001b[94msrc/builds.rs\u001b[m and \u001b[94msrc/imports.rs\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n      • Stock Lot supplier/part-number/notes merging logic is duplicated in \u001b[94mupsert_or_merge_stock_lot\u001b[m and\u001b[K\r\n      \u001b[94mmove_stock_lot_to_location\u001b[m in \u001b[94msrc/catalog.rs\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94m:memory:\u001b[m attachment directory fallback is duplicated in \u001b[94msrc/backup.rs\u001b[m and \u001b[94msrc/builds.rs\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mData Clumps (\u001b[m\u001b[94msrc/web.rs\u001b[m\u001b[1m)\u001b[m: \u001b[94mStageComponentImportForm\u001b[m and \u001b[94mSaveImportPresetForm\u001b[m repeat 11 \u001b[94mcol_*\u001b[m fields instead of\u001b[K\r\n  sharing a flattened struct.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[1m## Spec\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[39;1m (Soldered) Parts Refunded on Line Transitions (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:64, 151\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m parts are permanently\r\n  consumed per spec, but \u001b[94mtransition_bom_line_status\u001b[m, \u001b[94msplit_bom_line\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlink_bom_line_component\u001b[m, and\r\n  \u001b[94msubstitute_bom_line_component\u001b[m treated \u001b["]
[0.001, "o", "94m\"Installed\"\u001b[m like \u001b[94m\"Picked\"\u001b[m and refunded stock (or fabricated stock if\r\n  \u001b[94msource_lot_id\u001b[m was \u001b[94mNULL\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mStaged Import Batch Commits Atomicity (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:119, 198\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: \u001b[94mcommit_component_import_batch\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94mcommit_bom_import_batch\u001b[m executed row mutations outside an atomic transaction/rollback guard.\r\n  • \u001b[1mInline BOM Status \u001b[94;22mhx-patch\u001b[39;1m Attribute (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:175\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Inline BOM status buttons emitted \u001b[94mhx-post\u001b[m instead of \u001b[94mhx-patch\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mUbiquitous Language & \u001b[94;22mattachments\u001b[39;1m Adapter Module (\u001b[94;22mspec.md:122, 218\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Table \u001b[94mkit_log_entries\u001b[m vs. \u001b[94mbench_log_entries\u001b[m\r\n  and missing \u001b[94msrc/attachments.rs\u001b[m adapter module.\r\n\n  \u001b[1mSummary\u001b[m: 4 findings on Standards (worst: \u001b[94mkit_log_entries\u001b[m table name vs. \u001b[94mGLOSSARY.md\u001b[m \u001b[1mBench Log Entry\u001b[m), 4 findings on\r\n  Spec (worst: \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m parts being refunded to stock instead of staying permanently consumed).\r\n\n"]
