[0.065, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git checkout feat/audio-inventory && git merge --ff-only ticket-review-fixes && cargo test)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have merged \u001b[94mticket-review-fixes\u001b[m (\u001b[94m03fa5c6\u001b[m) into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m and launched \u001b[94mcargo test\u001b[m to verify the full\u001b[K\r\n  test suite on the integration branch. I will wait for it to finish and then clean up all implementer worktrees.\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mChecked\u001b[m 1 task \u001b[37m(task-194)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Now let's complete Steps 8 and 9 of \u001b[94m/implement-spec\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n  8. Resolve the spec and each ticket the way the local-markdown issue tracker closes work (\u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m in\r\n  \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m and all \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/*.md\u001b[m), and report the integration branch.\u001b[K\r\n  9. Clean up all \u001b[1mimplementer subagent\u001b[m worktrees (\u001b[94mgit worktree remove\u001b[m and delete temporary \u001b[94mticket-*\u001b[m branches).\r\n\u001b[K\n  Let's mark \u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m as \u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m, verify all 8 tickets in \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94minventory/issues/\u001b[m have \u001b[94m**Status:** resolved\u001b[m, commit, and remove all worktrees in \u001b[94m/tmp/audio-inventory-wt/\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(spec.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1mPending edit\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1m/Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m  \u001b[32m+1\u001b[m \u001b[31m-1\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m1 \u001b[39;48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m-  \u001b[39mStatus: open\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m1 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mStatus: resolved\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\n  "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[5.824, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[31A  Spec (worst: \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m parts being refunded to stock instead of staying permanently consumed).\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have launched a single fresh implementer subagent (\u001b[94mCode Review Fixer Implementer\u001b[m) in \u001b[94m/tmp/audio-inventory-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mwt/ticket-review-fixes\u001b[m to fix all of these issues, after which I will merge it into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m and clean\r\n  up all worktrees.\u001b[K\r\n\n  Now let's merge \u001b[94mticket-review-fixes\u001b[m (\u001b[94m03fa5c6\u001b[m) into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m, mark \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m, verify all 8 tickets in \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/\u001b[m are \u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m, run \u001b[94mcargo test\u001b[m,\r\n  and clean up all worktrees (\u001b[94mgit worktree remove\u001b[m + branch cleanup)! Let's run a command in the main workspace.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git checkout feat/audio-inventory && git merge --ff-only ticket-review-fixes && cargo test)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have merged \u001b[94mticke"]
