[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[28ANow let's merge \u001b[94mticket-review-fixes\u001b[m (\u001b[94m03fa5c6\u001b[m) into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m, mark \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m, verify all 8 tickets in \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/\u001b[m are \u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m, run \u001b[94mcargo test\u001b[m,\r\n  and clean up all worktrees (\u001b[94mgit worktree remove\u001b[m + branch cleanup)! Let's run a command in the main workspace.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(git checkout feat/audio-inventory && git merge --ff-only ticket-review-fixes && cargo test)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I have merged \u001b[94mticket-review-fixes\u001b[m (\u001b[94m03fa5c6\u001b[m) into \u001b[94mfeat/audio-inventory\u001b[m and launched \u001b[94mcargo test\u001b[m to verify the full\r\n  test suite on the integration branch. I will wait for it to finish and then clean up all implementer worktrees.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mChecked\u001b[m 1 task \u001b[37m(task-194)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Now let's complete Steps 8 and 9 of \u001b[94m/implement-spec\u001b[m:\r\n  8. Resol"]
[0.000, "o", "ve the spec and each ticket the way the local-markdown issue tracker closes work (\u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m in\r\n  \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m and all \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/*.md\u001b[m), and report the integration branch.\r\n  9. Clean up all \u001b[1mimplementer subagent\u001b[m worktrees (\u001b[94mgit worktree remove\u001b[m and delete temporary \u001b[94mticket-*\u001b[m branches).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Let's mark \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md\u001b[m as \u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m, verify all 8 tickets in \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94minventory/issues/\u001b[m have \u001b[94m**Status:** resolved\u001b[m, commit, and remove all worktrees in \u001b[94m/tmp/audio-inventory-wt/\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(spec.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Let's check the status of all 8 tickets in \u001b[94m.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/\u001b[m, commit the spec resolution, and clean\r\n  up all worktrees and temporary ticket branches.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(grep -H \"Status:\" .scratch/audio-inventory/spec.md .scratch/audio"]
