[0.000, "o", "d\u000702-component-catalog-parametric-search-and-stock-lots.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** (\u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m)\n\u001b[78D• \u001b[1mComponent\u001b[m cataloging across all 9 built-in categories + \u001b[94mOther / Custom\u001b[m, debounced HTMX parametric search\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mdelay:150ms\u001b[m) with live \u001b[94mspec_parser\u001b[m interpretation badge, dynamic category \u001b[94mspecs_json\u001b[m filters, recursive\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mStorage Location\u001b[m subtree filtering, inline single-lot \u001b[94m− / qty / +\u001b[m steppers, multi-lot Inspector Drawer, and\r\n\u001b[6Cautomatic/manual \u001b[1mStock Lot\u001b[m merging (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk30d70e23abff7b37;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/catalog.rs\u0007catalog.rs\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5caefe8d345f465b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs\u0007web.rs\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\r\n  3. **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk98ac8ea4197bd020;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/03-kit-builds-bom-matching-and-stock-fulfillment.md"]
