[2.352, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27A\u001b[4C• Profile-height stage-grouped \u001b[1mActive Bench Checklist\u001b[m (\u001b[94mStage 1\u001b[m–\u001b[94mStage 3\u001b[m), overall placement \u001b[94m<progress>\u001b[m bar,\r\n      tappable per-designator soldering chips (\u001b[94m[○ R1]\u001b[m, \u001b[94m[✓ R2]\u001b[m) that auto-transition lines to \u001b[94mInstalled\u001b[m when all\r\n\u001b[6Cplacements are checked, local file attachments & external URLs (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd45d2d5e1b6fdace;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/attachments.rs\u0007attachments.rs\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and chronological \u001b[1mBench Log\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mEntries\u001b[m (\u001b[94mbench_log_entries\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9f4a29304f8e2fc;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/builds.rs\u0007builds.rs\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\u001b[K\r\n  6. **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkccffba05f1827db9;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/06-staged-csv-and-clipboard-imports.md\u000706-staged-csv-and-clipboard-imports.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** (\u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m)\u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n      • Two-step staged CSV & clipboard imports for both \u001b[1mComponents\u001b[m/\u001b[1mStock Lots\u001b[m (Mouser, DigiKey, Tayda, LCSC, and\r\n\u001b[6Ccustom mapping presets; \u001b[94mExact Match\u001b[m / \u001b[94mNear / Ambiguous Match\u001b[m / \u001b[94mNo Match\u001b[m reconciliation; atomic transaction\r\n\u001b[6Ccommit) and \u001b[1mKit Build\u001b[m \u001b[1mBOMs\u001b[m (\u001b[94mAppend\u001b[m vs. \u001b[94mReplace Unallocated Lines\u001b[m, designator category inference, and \u001b[1m\"Automatic\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mDesignator Grouping\"\u001b[m) (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk34cad235f104c5d5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/imports.rs\u0007imports.rs\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007).\u001b[K\r\n  7. **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6590fbfd6e5805dd;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/.scratch/audio-inventory/issues/07-multi-build-shopping-list-exports-and-order-receiving.md\u000707-multi-build-shopping-list-exports-and-order-receiving.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** (\u001b[94mStatus: resolved\u001b[m)\r\n      • Live multi-build \u001b[1mShopping List\u001b[m aggregating combined demand across selected \u001b[1mKit Builds\u001b["]
