[0.000, "o", "dialog>\u001b[m substitution modal, and transitioned BOM lines between \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m\r\n  from both the table row and the inspector drawer.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mActive Bench Checklist (\u001b[94;22m/checklist\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Verified 3-stage assembly grouping, toggled individual reference designator\r\n  soldering chips (\u001b[94m○ R1\u001b[m → \u001b[94m✓ R1\u001b[m) with live progress bar updates, and recorded timestamped bench log entries.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mShopping List (\u001b[94;22m/shopping-list\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Verified multi-build shortfall calculation (\u001b[94mTL072\u001b[m shortfall of 2), supplier\r\n  quick-order CSV clipboard preview, and stock receiving controls.\r\n  5. \u001b[1mCSV Import (\u001b[94;22m/imports\u001b[39;1m) & Backup/Restore (\u001b[94;22m/settings\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Staged a Mouser CSV import, verified exact-match vs. no-\r\n  match reconciliation preview, committed the batch atomically, and verified the \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m snapshot/restore settings\r\n  surface.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Issues Found in the Browser & Fixed\u001b[m\r\n\n  1."]
