[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  1. \u001b[1mComponent Catalog & Storage Locations (\u001b[m\u001b[94m/catalog\u001b[m\u001b[1m, \u001b[m\u001b[94m/locations\u001b[m\u001b[1m)\u001b[m: Created hierarchical storage locations (\u001b[94mResistor\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[94mBinder A\u001b[m), tested parametric shorthand filtering, inspected components and stock lots in the right-hand drawer, and\r\n  incremented/decremented stock lot quantities both inline and from the inspector drawer.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mKit Build BOM (\u001b[94;22m/builds\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Created a kit build (\u001b[94mKlon Centaur Overdrive (#1)\u001b[m), added BOM lines (\u001b[94mR1, R2, R3\u001b[m \u001b[94m4k7 1%\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m1/4W Metal Film\u001b[m, \u001b[94mIC1, IC2\u001b[m \u001b[94mTL072 Dual Op-Amp DIP-8\u001b[m), created a catalog component directly from an unlinked BOM line,\r\n  opened the native \u001b[94m<dialog>\u001b[m substitution modal, and transitioned BOM lines between \u001b[94mUnallocated\u001b[m, \u001b[94mReserved\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mPicked\u001b[m\r\n  from both the table row and the inspector drawer.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mActive Bench Checklist (\u001b[94;22m/checklist\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Verified 3-stage assembly grouping, toggled i"]
[0.000, "o", "ndividual reference designator\r\n  soldering chips (\u001b[94m○ R1\u001b[m → \u001b[94m✓ R1\u001b[m) with live progress bar updates, and recorded timestamped bench log entries.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mShopping List (\u001b[94;22m/shopping-list\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Verified multi-build shortfall calculation (\u001b[94mTL072\u001b[m shortfall of 2), supplier\r\n  quick-order CSV clipboard preview, and stock receiving controls.\r\n  5. \u001b[1mCSV Import (\u001b[94;22m/imports\u001b[39;1m) & Backup/Restore (\u001b[94;22m/settings\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Staged a Mouser CSV import, verified exact-match vs. no-\r\n  match reconciliation preview, committed the batch atomically, and verified the \u001b[94m.zip\u001b[m snapshot/restore settings\r\n  surface.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Issues Found in the Browser & Fixed\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mUnscoped \u001b[94;22mhx-trigger\u001b[39;1m on the Catalog filter ribbon wiped out Inspector Drawer inputs while typing\u001b[m\n\u001b[94D• \u001b[1mCause\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5285648297b7fe45;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L1429-L1435\u0007render_ca"]
[0.000, "o", "talog_and_locations_workspace\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, the filter form used \u001b[94mhx-trigger=\"input changed delay:150ms\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mfrom:input, change from:select, search, submit\"\u001b[m. In HTMX, \u001b[94mfrom:input\u001b[m and \u001b[94mfrom:select\u001b[m without \u001b[94mfind\u001b[m match every\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m<input>\u001b[m and \u001b[94m<select>\u001b[m in the entire \u001b[94mdocument\u001b[m, so typing into the right-hand Inspector Drawer triggered a \u001b[94mGET\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/catalog\u001b[m refresh 150ms later and reset the drawer.\n\u001b[50D• \u001b[1mFix\u001b[m: Scoped the trigger selectors to descendants of the filter form using \u001b[94mfrom:find input, change from:find\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mselect\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mOut-of-band \u001b[94;22m<tr>\u001b[39;1m swaps (\u001b[94;22mhx-swap-oob=\"true\"\u001b[39;1m) were stripped by the browser's HTML5 parser\u001b[m\n\u001b[86D• \u001b[1mCause\u001b[m: Whe\r\n\n⣟  \u001b[90mLoading..\u001b[94m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: In /diff, press c to add inline comments and send them as feedback.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
