[0.022, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\u001b[J\u001b[5A\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m? for shortcuts\u001b[m\u001b[82X\u001b[82C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[8.296, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\u001b[90mpress ctrl+d again to exit\u001b[m\u001b[2A\u001b[24D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.808, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A\u001b[K\r\nResume with -c (or command below):\u001b[K\r\nagy --conversation=73c7d66f-3e6d-482e-b6c3-e4ac2575a049\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  1. \u001b[1mUnscoped \u001b[94;22mhx-trigger\u001b[39;1m on the Catalog filter ribbon wiped out Inspector Drawer inputs while typing\u001b[m\n\u001b[94D• \u001b[1mCause\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk210c6fce18685313;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L1429-L1435\u0007render_catalog_and_locations_workspace\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, the filter form used \u001b[94mhx-trigger=\"input changed delay:150ms\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mfrom:input, change from:select, search, submit\"\u001b[m. In HTMX, \u001b[94mfrom:input\u001b[m and \u001b[94mfrom:select\u001b[m without \u001b[94mfind\u001b[m match every\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m<input>\u001b[m and \u001b[94m<select>\u001b[m in the entire \u001b[94mdocument\u001b[m, so typing into the right-hand Inspector Drawer triggered a \u001b[94mGET\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/catalog\u001b[m refresh 150ms later and reset the drawer.\n\u001b[50D• \u001b[1mFix\u001b[m: Scoped the trigger selectors to descendants of the filter form using \u001b[94mfrom:find input, change from:find\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[94mselect\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mOut-of-band \u001b[94;22m<tr>\u001b[39;1m swaps (\u001b[94;22mhx-swap-oob=\"true\"\u001b[39;1m) were stripped by the browser's HTML5 parser\u001b[m\n\u001b[86D• \u001b[1mCause\u001b[m: When \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdc8933f0a3f1f4c9;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L1253-L1259\u0007render_component_row_oob\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 or \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9c45913f558d73ad;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L2567-L2573\u0007render_bom_line_row_oob\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 returned a bare \u001b[94m<tr id=\"...\" hx-swap-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94moob=\"true\">\u001b[m after \u001b[94m<aside id=\"inspector\">\u001b[m, the browser's \u001b[94mDOMParser\u001b[m parsed the response in HTML \u001b[94m\"in body\"\u001b[m mode\r\n\u001b[6Cand stripped the \u001b[94m<tr>\u001b[m/\u001b[94m<th>\u001b[m/\u001b[94m<td>\u001b[m tags before HTMX could process \u001b[94mhx-swap-oob\u001b[m, leaving the table row stale and\r\n\u001b[6Cdumping the cell contents at the bottom of the grid.\n\u001b[52D• \u001b[1mFix\u001b[m: Wrapped out-of-band \u001b[94m<tr>\u001b[m elements in \u001b[94m<template>...</template>\u001b[m, which HTMX 2.0.4 na"]
[0.000, "o", "tively unwraps for \u001b[94mhx-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mswap-oob\u001b[m while preserving valid HTML5 table-row parsing.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mInspector Drawer side-by-side form fields overflowed the 340px drawer column\u001b[m\n\u001b[75D• \u001b[1mCause\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkafe164630eb73587;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/assets/styles.css#L376-L391\u0007styles.css:376-391\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[94m.form-grid\u001b[m and \u001b[94m.form-field\u001b[m lacked \u001b[94mmin-inline-size: 0\u001b[m / \u001b[94mminmax(0, 1fr)\u001b[m, allowing\r\n\u001b[6Cdefault \u001b[94m<input>\u001b[m intrinsic widths in side-by-side flex rows to push the form wider than the 340px drawer.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mFix\u001b[m: Added \u001b[94mgrid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr)\u001b[m on \u001b[94m.form-grid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmin-inline-size: 0\u001b[m on \u001b[94m.form-field\u001b[m, and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94minline-size: 100%; min-inline-size: 0\u001b[m on \u001b[94m.form-field :is(input, select, textarea)\u001b[m.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mTop surface navigation tabs kept a stale active highlight during HTMX tab switches\u001b[m\n\u001b[81D• \u001b[1mCause\u001b[m: Clicking a tab in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2c"]
[0.000, "o", "e4240609dac24a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L704-L735\u0007render_subnav\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 updated \u001b[94m#app-root\u001b[m, leaving \u001b[94mnav.va-subnav\u001b[m outside \u001b[94m#app-root\u001b[m with \u001b[94maria-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mselected=\"true\"\u001b[m stuck on the initial tab.\n\u001b[41D• \u001b[1mFix\u001b[m: Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk39713a9c9e986ca6;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L627-L651\u0007render_page_or_partial\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk377581a2e6cf9880;file:///Users/brett/Demos/audio-inventory-experiment/audio_inventory_skilled/src/web.rs#L708-L735\u0007render_subnav_inner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to include an out-of-band \u001b[94mnav#workbench-subnav\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cswap when \u001b[94mHX-Target\u001b[m is \u001b[94mapp-root\u001b[m.\r\n\n\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
